msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Farewell, $C. You'll be missed."
msgstr "Adiós, $C. Le echaremos de menos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/1/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "It is always sad to lose a pilot..."
msgstr "Siempre es triste perder un piloto..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "... but it is especially difficult when he is as young as $C."
msgstr "...pero es especialmente difícil cuando es tan joven como $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "He died without even a chance to prove himself."
msgstr "Murió sin ni siquiera tener la oportunidad de demostrar su valía."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/2/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "In just a few missions, $C began to turn the tide of this operation."
msgstr "Con pocas misiones, $C ya empezó a cambiar el rumbo de esta operación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Now his contributions have been cut short."
msgstr "Ahora su contribución se ha truncado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Who can say what $C might have accomplished for the Confederation?"
msgstr "¿Quién sabe lo que podría haber logrado $C para la Confederación?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/3/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Without a doubt, $C was one of the Confederation's finest pilots."
msgstr "Sin duda, $C era uno de los mejores pilotos de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Time after time, he led the Confederation forces to victory."
msgstr "Ha llevado repetidas veces a las fuerzas de la Confederación a la victoria."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "Now, as we press on to victory, we bid farewell to a true hero."
msgstr "Ahora, a punto de saborear la victoria, nos despedimos de un héroe de verdad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/4/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "As we all know, this operation has been long and hard."
msgstr "Como todos sabemos, esta operación ha sido larga y dura."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "No one fought harder to accomplish our objectives than $C."
msgstr "Nadie luchó tan duro para conseguir nuestros objetivos como $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Now he has made the ultimate sacrifice for the Confederation."
msgstr "Ahora ha hecho el sacrificio definitivo para la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/0"
msgid "Goodbye, Spirit ... I will miss your soft-spoken advice."
msgstr "Adiós, Spirit... echaré de menos tus afables consejos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/1"
msgid "I'll lift a glass to your memory, Hunter. Goodbye."
msgstr "Haré un brindis en tu honor, Hunter. Adiós."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/2"
msgid "I'll try to follow your example of leadership, Bossman. Goodbye."
msgstr "Intentaré seguir tu ejemplo de liderazgo, Bossman. Adiós."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/3"
msgid "Goodbye, Iceman. I'll nail the bastard that got you."
msgstr "Adiós, Iceman. Acabaré con el bastardo que te derribó."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/4"
msgid "Au revoir, Angel. I will fight the Kilrathi as you did, with all my heart."
msgstr "Au revoir, Angel. Lucharé contra los Kilrathi igual que tú lo hiciste, con todo mi corazón."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/5"
msgid "Goodbye, Paladin. I'll never forget the help you've given me."
msgstr "Adiós, Paladín. Nunca olvidaré la ayuda que me has dado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/6"
msgid "Goodbye, Maniac. I guess you got what you deserved."
msgstr "Adiós, Maniac. Supongo que tienes lo que te mereces."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/5/record/7"
msgid "Farewell, Knight. I will always remember you."
msgstr "Hasta siempre, Knight. Siempre te recordaré."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/0"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay our last respects to a good friend..."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar el pésame a un buen amigo..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/1"
msgid "...and one of the Terran Confederation's boldest defenders."
msgstr "...y uno de los más audaces defensores de la Confederación Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/2"
msgid "Lieutenant Mariko Tanaka was never loud or angry in her speech..."
msgstr "La Teniente Mariko Tanaka nunca fue ruidosa ni molesta en sus discursos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/3"
msgid "...but her actions spoke louder than her words."
msgstr "...pero sus acciones tenían más fuerza que sus palabras."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/4"
msgid "We will all miss her skill and devotion to the Confederate cause."
msgstr "Todos echaremos de menos su habilidad y devoción por la causa Confederada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/5"
msgid "Captain Ian St. John never let the the fatigue of battle wear him down."
msgstr "El Capitán Ian St. John nunca dejó que el cansancio de la batalla le desgastara."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/6"
msgid "His spirited attitude and passion for duty were without equal."
msgstr "Su animada actitud y pasión por el deber no tenían comparación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/7"
msgid "Now that he's gone, you should all strive to find in yourselves..."
msgstr "Ahora que ya no está, todos debemos esforzarnos por encontrar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/8"
msgid "...the strength of character that Captain St. John possessed."
msgstr "...la fortaleza de carácter que poseía el Capitán St. John."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/9"
msgid "Sadly, we must pay our last respects to a seasoned veteran..."
msgstr "Tristemente, debemos dar el pésame a un veterano avezado..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/10"
msgid "...Major Kien Chen, whom we all knew as Bossman."
msgstr "...el Mayor Kien Chen, al que todos conocíamos como Bossman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/11"
msgid "In our time of uncertainty, Major Chen was always ready to lend himself..."
msgstr "En estos tiempos de incertidumbre, el Mayor Chen siempre estuvo listo para entregarse..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/12"
msgid "...to anyone who needed guidance. He will be missed."
msgstr "...a cualquiera que necesitara orientación. Le echaremos de menos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/13"
msgid "Iceman, Major Michael Casey, was one of the best to ever fly a starfighter."
msgstr "Iceman, el Mayor Michael Casey, era uno de los mejores volando en un caza estelar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/14"
msgid "His taciturn approach to his duties was fueled by a drive to win..."
msgstr "Su criterio taciturno del deber estaba alimentado por el deseo de vencer..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/15"
msgid "...whatever the odds. He died as he lived..."
msgstr "...sin importar las probabilidades. Murió como había vivido..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/16"
msgid "...fighting against the enemy to preserve the lives of his fellows."
msgstr "...luchando contra el enemigo para preservar las vidas de sus compañeros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/17"
msgid "I am saddened to note the passage of one of our most devoted warriors..."
msgstr "Me entristece mencionar la muerte de una de nuestras guerreras más devotas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/18"
msgid "...our friend, Captain Jeanette Devereaux."
msgstr "...nuestra amiga, la Capitana Jeannette Devereaux."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/19"
msgid "She gave everything she was to combat the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Dio todo lo que era para combatir a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/20"
msgid "She has now made the final sacrifice for the Confederation."
msgstr "Ahora ha hecho el sacrificio definitivo para la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/21"
msgid "We now bid farewell to our comrade, Major James Taggart."
msgstr "Nos encontramos para despedirnos de nuestro camarada, el Mayor James Taggart."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/22"
msgid "His tactical knowledge has saved many lives and often thwarted the enemy."
msgstr "Su conocimiento táctico ha salvado muchas vidas y a menudo frustrado los planes del enemigo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/23"
msgid "We will all miss his skill and friendship..."
msgstr "Todos echaremos de menos su habilidad y amistad..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/24"
msgid "...as we continue the fight that he started years ago."
msgstr "...mientras seguimos la lucha que empezó años atrás."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/25"
msgid "Second Lieutenant Todd Marshall was one of our youngest pilots..."
msgstr "El Alférez Todd Marshall era uno de nuestros pilotos más jóvenes..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/26"
msgid "...and perhaps misunderstood in his methods of battle."
msgstr "...y tal vez un incomprendido con sus métodos de combate."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/27"
msgid "Although he often spoke of his desire to die in combat..."
msgstr "Aunque a menudo hablaba de su deseo de morir en combate..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/28"
msgid "...his death is truly our loss. Farewell, Lt. Marshall."
msgstr "...su muerte es realmente nuestra pérdida. Hasta siempre, Alférez Marshall."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/29"
msgid "We must now say goodbye to Captain Joseph Khumalo."
msgstr "Nos encontramos para despedirnos del Capitán Joseph Khumalo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/30"
msgid "Knight was always looking to give support and assistance..."
msgstr "Knight siempre estaba tratando de dar apoyo y soporte..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/31"
msgid "...whether he was in the cockpit or aboard ship."
msgstr "...ya fuera en la cabina de un caza o a bordo de la nave."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/0/scene/6/record/32"
msgid "His rock-solid attitude was a pillar of strength for all of us."
msgstr "Su actitud fuerte como una roca era un pilar de fortaleza para todos nosotros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Colonel Halcyon's office.\n$T, $D."
msgstr "Oficina del Coronel Halcyon\n$T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "$N. Come in, I need to speak with you."
msgstr "$N. Entre. Necesito hablar con usted."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr "¿Sí, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "I've been looking over the performance reviews."
msgstr "He estado repasando las evaluaciones de rendimiento."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "I've been reviewing your record, and I have good news..."
msgstr "He revisando su registro, y tengo buenas noticias..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "I've decided to promote you, effective immediately."
msgstr "He decidido ascenderle, con efecto inmediato."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Congratulations, $R $N. Keep up the good work."
msgstr "Felicidades, $R $N. Siga con el buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Thank you, sir. I'll do my best."
msgstr "Gracias, Señor. Haré todo lo que pueda."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Good.  Now, another thing I need to speak to you about..."
msgstr "Bien. A ver, hay otra cosa de la que le quiero hablar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "That ship you just bailed out of cost over a hundred million credits."
msgstr "Esa nave de la que se ha eyectado, costó cientos de millones de créditos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "We'll have to wait until our return to Vega before the Tiger's Claw receives a replacement."
msgstr "Tendremos que esperar hasta regresar a Vega antes de que la Garra de Tigre reciba una de recambio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "I know, sir.  But there wasn't anything else I could do...."
msgstr "Lo sé, Señor. Pero no podía hacer otra cosa..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "If you have no choice but to eject, then do it..."
msgstr "Si la única opción que tiene es eyectar, hágalo..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "...but don't let me catch you bailing out of a ship you could've flown home."
msgstr "...pero que no le pille haciéndolo en una nave que hubiera podido traer a casa volando."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "You're about to receive a Golden Sun for ejecting and surviving..."
msgstr "Va a recibir un Sol Dorado por eyectarse y sobrevivir..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "But you only get one of those per career."
msgstr "Pero solo se consigue uno en la profesión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "After that, ejecting is just a waste of the Confederation's starfighters."
msgstr "Después de eso, eyectarse solo hace que se malgasten los cazas de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "I won't forget it, sir."
msgstr "No lo olvidaré, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "I'm counting on it, $R."
msgstr "Cuento con ello, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Just a moment, $C. I have one more thing to tell you."
msgstr "Un momento, $C. Tengo que decirle algo más."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "We're having to change some pilot assignments."
msgstr "Vamos a tener que cambiar algunas asignaciones de pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Effective immediately, you'll be reassigned."
msgstr "Queda reasignado, con efecto inmediato."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "You'll be flying Hornets with the Killer Bees again."
msgstr "Volverá a volar en Hornets con las Abejas Asesinas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "You'll be in a Scimitar-class medium fighter, with Blue Devil Squadron."
msgstr "Irá en un caza medio de clase Scimitar, con el Escuadrón Diablo Azul."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "I need you in Star Slayer Squadron, flying a Raptor-class heavy fighter."
msgstr "Le necesito en el Escuadrón Cazador Estelar, volando en un caza pesado de clase Raptor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "I want you in one of the new Rapier-class mediums, in Black Lion Squadron."
msgstr "Le quiero en uno de esos cazas medianos nuevos de Clase Rapier, en el Escuadrón León Negro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "I see, sir. I'll do my best."
msgstr "Entiendo, Señor. Haré lo que pueda."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "I'm curious, sir...why?"
msgstr "Tengo curiosidad, Señor... ¿por qué?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "We've lost pilots, $C, and a lot of fighters."
msgstr "$C, hemos perdido pilotos, y muchos cazas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "Until we have more fighters repaired and combat-ready..."
msgstr "Hasta que no tengamos más cazas reparados y listos para el combate..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "...I have to shift personnel to keep the maximum number of ships active."
msgstr "...tengo que transferir al personal para mantener el máximo número de naves activas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "I understand, sir.  I'll do the best I can, no matter what ship I'm assigned to."
msgstr "Lo entiendo, Señor. Haré todo lo que pueda, sea cual sea la nave a la que me asignen."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "Good, pilot. I'm glad to hear it."
msgstr "Bien, piloto. Me alegro de oír eso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/1/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "That's all, $R. Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, $R. Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Hangar deck.\n18:00 hours, $D."
msgstr "Cubierta del Hangar\n18:00, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "For excellence in combat with the Kilrathi enemy..."
msgstr "Por la excelencia en el combate con el enemigo Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "In consideration of his valorous service to humanity..."
msgstr "Teniendo en cuenta su valeroso servicio a la humanidad..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Leading the forces of the Confederation against the Empire of Kilrah..."
msgstr "Dirigiendo las fuerzas de la Confederación contra el Imperio de Kilrah..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Taking a decisive role in Operation Thor's Hammer..."
msgstr "Desempeñando un papel decisivo en la Operación Martillo de Thor..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And commanding the squadron which accomplished the pivotal victory..."
msgstr "Y dirigiendo el escuadrón que llevó a cabo la victoria crucial..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "For bravely sacrificing his vessel and endangering his life..."
msgstr "Al sacrificar valientemente su nave y poniendo en peligro su vida..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "In combat with the Kilrathi enemy..."
msgstr "En combate con el enemigo Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "...on or about $E,"
msgstr "...en el $E,"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "The Terran Confederation presents the $A to $R $N."
msgstr "la Confederación Terrestre otorga $A al $R $N."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Your courage is an example to the Confederation's finest defenders."
msgstr "Su coraje es un ejemplo para los mayores defensores de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "You will be counted as one of the greatest heroes of humanity."
msgstr "Será considerado como uno de los héroes más grandes de la humanidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Your dedication honors all of the Confederation."
msgstr "Su dedicación honra a toda la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Well done, $C.\nCongratulations."
msgstr "Bien hecho, $C.\nFelicidades."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Thank you, sir."
msgstr "Gracias, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/2/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Filled with pride, you meet the applause of your crewmates."
msgstr "Lleno de orgullo, recibes el aplauso de tus compañeros de la tripulación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Quiet, everyone.  We have a lot of ground to cover."
msgstr "Silencio todo el mundo. Tenemos mucho terreno que cubrir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "As you may have noticed, the Tiger's Claw has made several jumps today..."
msgstr "Como deben haber observado, hoy la Garra de Tigre ha hecho varios saltos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "...because we've been temporarily ordered out of Vega Sector."
msgstr "...porque nos han ordenado que salgamos temporalmente del Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Several hours ago, we received an emergency communication..."
msgstr "Hace varias horas, hemos recibido una comunicación de emergencia..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "... from the Goddard colony in the Deneb sector."
msgstr "...de la Colonia Goddard, en el Sector Deneb."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "A Kilrathi fleet has attacked the colony, using some kind of new weapon."
msgstr "Una flota Kilrathi ha atacado esta colonia, usando algún tipo de arma nueva."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Unfortunately, we've lost communications with the colony."
msgstr "Por desgracia, hemos perdido las comunicaciones con la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Now we're preparing to jump to Goddard."
msgstr "Ahora nos preparamos para saltar a Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Sir? Does this mean we don't know what kind of mess we're jumping into?"
msgstr "¿Señor? ¿Esto significa que no sabemos en qué tipo de embrollo nos estamos metiendo?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Right. We don't know the full extent of the Kilrathi fleet..."
msgstr "Correcto. No conocemos la extensión completa de la flota Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "...and we don't know what's happened to the Goddard colony."
msgstr "...y no sabemos qué le ha ocurrido a la Colonia Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "For now, NO ONE is to talk about this to the crew. However, we won't be alone..."
msgstr "Por ahora, NADIE hablará de esto con la tripulación. Sin embargo, no estaremos solos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "...as we're scheduled to make a rendezvous with the Hickok."
msgstr "...ya que tenemos programado reunirnos con la Hickok."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "She's a Dilligent-class 'sport loaded with emergency relief supplies for the colony."
msgstr "Es un transporte de clase Dilligent cargado con suministros de emergencia para la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Also, we rendezvous with the Marciano, a Venture-class corvette."
msgstr "Además, nos reuniremos con la Marciano, una corbeta de clase Venture."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Mission assignments:  Alpha Wing will patrol in Hornets...we need you in our fastest ships."
msgstr "Asignaciones de la misión: el Ala Alpha patrullará en Hornets... les necesitamos en nuestras naves más rápidas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "You'll launch immediately when we appear in the Goddard system."
msgstr "Nada más aparecer en el Sistema Goddard, saldrán de inmediato."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "If there are any cats in our vicinity, eliminate them."
msgstr "Si hay algún gato en el vecindario, lo eliminan."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Then I want you to go to Nav 1 and scout for any other Kilrathi activity."
msgstr "Después quiero que vayan a Nav 1 y rastreen cualquier otra actividad Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Afterwards, proceed to Nav Point 2, where the Hickok is preparing to jump to Goddard... "
msgstr "A continuación, vayan al Punto Nav 2, donde la Hickok se está preparando para saltar a Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "...and provide support for her if the Kilrathi attack."
msgstr "...y si los Kilrathi atacan, le ofrecerán apoyo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Once she's jumped, go to Nav Point 3, where you'll meet with the Marciano."
msgstr "Una vez haya saltado, vayan al Punto Nav 3, donde se reunirán con la Marciano."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Escort the corvette back to the Claw, eliminating any threats."
msgstr "Escolten la corbeta de vuelta a la Garra, eliminando cualquier amenaza."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "$C, you're wingleader, with Hunter as your wingman."
msgstr "$C, usted es el líder del ala, y Hunter será su copiloto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "$C, you'll be flying solo on this one."
msgstr "$C, en esta volará en solitario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "The colonel moves on to the other wing and squad assignments."
msgstr "El coronel sigue adelante con el resto de asignaciones de alas y escuadrones."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "Your attention snaps back to him as he concludes."
msgstr "Vuelves repentinamente tu atención hacia él mientras finaliza."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "That's all. Ladies and gentlemen, prepare for launch."
msgstr "Eso es todo. Damas y caballeros, prepárense para salir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Okay. You'll have to launch again in a few minutes, so let's make this quick."
msgstr "Bien. En pocos minutos tendrá que volver a salir, así que no me andaré con rodeos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Your report, $C."
msgstr "Su informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "A Lumbari-class tanker was getting ready to jump out at Nav 1.  It's history, sir."
msgstr "Un carguero cisterna de clase Lumbari se estaba preparando para saltar en Nav 1. Ya es historia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "A Lumbari-class tanker was getting ready to jump out at Nav 1.  I couldn't stop it, sir."
msgstr "Un carguero cisterna de clase Lumbari se estaba preparando para saltar en Nav 1. No pude detenerle, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "And we were able to keep the Kilrathi away from the Hicock.  She's headed for the colony now."
msgstr "Y conseguimos mantener alejados a los Kilrathi de la Hickok. Ahora se está dirigiendo a la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And I was able to keep the Kilrathi away from the Hicock.  She's headed for the colony now."
msgstr "Y conseguí mantener alejados a los Kilrathi de la Hickok. Ahora se está dirigiendo a la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "And we weren't able to keep the Kilrathi away from the Hicock.  I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "Y no conseguimos mantener alejados a los Kilrathi de la Hickok. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "And I wasn't able to keep the Kilrathi away from the Hicock.  I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "Y no conseguí mantener alejados a los Kilrathi de la Hickok. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "At Nav 3, we protected the Marciano from a squadron of Krants."
msgstr "En Nav 3, protegimos la Marciano de un escuadrón de Krants."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "At Nav 3, I protected the Marciano from a squadron of Krants."
msgstr "En Nav 3, protegí la Marciano de un escuadrón de Krants."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "At Nav 3, we couldn't prevent the loss of the Marciano."
msgstr "En Nav 3, no pudimos evitar perder la Marciano."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "At Nav 3, I couldn't prevent the loss of the Marciano."
msgstr "En Nav 3, no pude evitar perder la Marciano."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "And Hunter didn't make it back."
msgstr "Y Hunter no ha conseguido volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "That's right, sir. My fault. I didn't cover him when it counted."
msgstr "Es cierto, Señor. Es culpa mía. No le cubrí cuando hizo falta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "It was his job to cover YOU, $C, AND himself. This time out..."
msgstr "Su trabajo era cubrirle a USTED, $C, Y a él mismo. En esta ocasión..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "... he failed, and it cost him his life."
msgstr "...la culpa fue de él, y le ha costado la vida."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "For the record, your recorder credits you with killing $K, $C..."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, su caja negra le otorga $K muertes, $C..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "$C, you came up with no kills.  You'll have to do better than that..."
msgstr "$C, ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte. Tendrá que hacerlo mejor..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "... and Hunter came up with $L."
msgstr "...y Hunter ha vuelto con $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "...and Hunter came up empty."
msgstr "...y Hunter ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "Then we lost him."
msgstr "Además lo hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "A waste of a damn fine pilot."
msgstr "Hemos desperdiciado un excelente piloto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "All right.  You have ten minutes, then get back to Briefing."
msgstr "Está bien. Tiene diez minutos, después vuelva a la Sesión Informativa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Oh, as soon as possible, $C, I need to see you in my office."
msgstr "Oh, y $C, necesito verle en mi oficina lo antes posible."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Well, hiya, $C!"
msgstr "Anda, ¡hola, $C!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Things are happening around here. We've been making a lot of jumps."
msgstr "Aquí están pasando cosas muy raras. Hemos hecho un montón de saltos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "A LOT of jumps. You don't have to be an active-duty pilot..."
msgstr "MUCHISIMOS saltos. No hay que ser un piloto en activo..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "...to realize that something unusual is happening."
msgstr "...para darse cuenta de que ocurre algo raro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Keep your ears open, and let me know what you hear, okay?"
msgstr "Mantenga los oídos bien abiertos, y dígame de qué se ha enterado, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C! Sit down, have a drink.  I was just thinking about a story I'd heard---"
msgstr "¡$C! Siéntese, tome algo. Justo estaba pensando en una historia que he oído..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "---about the Gwenhyvar, an Exeter-class ship that disappeared a few years ago."
msgstr "...sobre la Gwenhyvar, una nave de clase Exeter que desapareció hace unos años."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "You don't really believe that old fairy tale, do you?"
msgstr "¿Usted no se creerá en serio ese viejo cuento chino, verdad?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I don't think it's a fairy tale, Ice."
msgstr "Yo no creo que sea un cuento chino, Ice."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I've never heard this story, Bossman.  What happened to the Gwenhyvar?"
msgstr "Yo nunca he oído esta historia, Bossman. ¿Qué le ocurrió a la Gwenhyvar?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "Supposedly the Kilrathi captured it intact in dry dock, with all of its fighter complement and some of the crew...."
msgstr "Se supone que los Kilrathi la capturaron intacta en un dique seco, con toda la dotación de cazas y algunos tripulantes..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "...and they've used it to deceive and destroy other Confederation ships."
msgstr "...y la usaron para burlar y destruir otras naves de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "No one who's encountered the Gwenhyvar has survived to tell the tale."
msgstr "Nadie que se haya encontrado con la Gwenhyvar ha sobrevivido para contar la historia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "I'll believe it when I see it."
msgstr "Yo me lo creeré cuando la vea."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Strange things going on."
msgstr "Están ocurriendo cosas muy extrañas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I was on the bridge a few hours ago."
msgstr "Estuve en el puente hace unas horas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Tiger's Claw received a coded transmission..."
msgstr "La Garra de Tigre ha recibido una transmisión codificada..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "...from High Command. The Colonel read it..."
msgstr "...del Alto Mando. El coronel la leyó..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "... and ordered non-essentials off the bridge."
msgstr "...y ordenó que el personal no esencial saliera del puente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Since then, we've been jumping like crazy."
msgstr "Desde entonces, hemos estado saltando sin parar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "We'll know what's happening soon enough, Iceman."
msgstr "Pronto sabremos qué está sucediendo, Iceman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/4/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "True. Very true."
msgstr "Cierto. Muy cierto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D\nHeading to the Goddard Colony."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nRumbo a la Colonia Goddard"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, we don't have much time."
msgstr "Venga, no tenemos mucho tiempo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We're making full speed to Goddard."
msgstr "Vamos a toda máquina hacia Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And the crews are doing emergency repairs on damaged fighters."
msgstr "Y las tripulaciones hacen reparaciones de emergencia en los cazas dañados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Early telemetry indicates that no Kilrathi capital ships..."
msgstr "La telemetría inicial indica que no hay naves insignia Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "...stayed behind in the Goddard system, but we've had reports of some smaller ships."
msgstr "...que se hayan quedado atrás en el Sistema Goddard, pero tenemos informes de naves más pequeñas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Therefore, you Killer Bees will go search and destroy."
msgstr "Por lo tanto, las Abejas Asesinas irán a buscar y destruir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Scour the Goddard system, and engage and destroy any remaining Kilrathi."
msgstr "Exploren el Sistema Goddard, y ataquen y destruyan cualquier Kilrathi que quede."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Tactical shows bogies heading this way...fighters left behind to hunt for 'sports."
msgstr "Operaciones muestra enemigos que se dirigen hacia aquí... son cazas que se han quedado atrás para derribar transportes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Kappa wing is $C and Hunter. You'll start by going after those fighters."
msgstr "El Ala Kappa la formarán $C y Hunter. Empezará persiguiendo a estos cazas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Kappa wing is $C. I'm counting on you to trash those fighters."
msgstr "El Ala Kappa la formará $C. Cuento con usted para acabar con esos cazas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Once you've taken care of them, you'll swing out to clear our path into the colony."
msgstr "Una vez se haya encargado de ellos, dará la vuelta para despejar el camino hacia la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Here's the setup..."
msgstr "Este es el plan..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "...you'll jump to Nav Point One, where long range scans show something moving.  Delete it."
msgstr "...saltará al Punto Nav 1, donde los sensores de largo alcance muestran algo en movimiento. Bórrelo del mapa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "At Nav 2, you'll find a Dorkir-class troop carrier.  They may be trying to leave the system.  Don't let them."
msgstr "En Nav 2, encontrará un transporte de tropas de clase Dorkir. Tal vez intenten dejar el sistema. No deje que lo hagan."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "When you've accomplished these objectives, return to the Claw."
msgstr "Cuando haya terminado con esos objetivos, vuelva a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Next is Maniac and Spirit on Beta Wing..."
msgstr "A continuación les toca a Maniac y a Spirit en el Ala Beta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "The Colonel briefs the other wings as you consider your orders..."
msgstr "El coronel informa a las otras alas mientras piensas en tus órdenes..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Remember, there are a quarter million colonists in danger.  Don't make any mistakes, pilots."
msgstr "Recuerden, hay un cuarto de millón de colonos en peligro. No cometan errores, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Our comm people still haven't been able to raise anyone on Goddard... "
msgstr "Nuestra gente de comunicaciones todavía no ha sido capaz de contactar con alguien de Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "... but our landing crews are now nearing the colony itself."
msgstr "...pero nuestras tripulaciones de desembarco se están acercando ahora a la misma colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "With any luck, we'll know something soon."
msgstr "Si tenemos suerte, pronto sabremos algo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "All right, then. You cruised out towards Nav Point One, and...?"
msgstr "Muy bien, pues. Ha navegado hacia el Punto Nav 1, ¿y...?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "That's where we stopped the Lumbari, sir."
msgstr "Ahí es donde hemos terminado con la Lumbari, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "That's where I stopped the Lumbari, sir."
msgstr "Ahí es donde he terminado con la Lumbari, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "We couldn't get the Lumbari, sir. I hope that someone else gets a shot at her."
msgstr "No conseguimos acabar con la Lumbari, Señor. Espero que alguien consiga derribarla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I couldn't get the Lumbari, sir. I hope that someone else gets a shot at her."
msgstr "No conseguí acabar con la Lumbari, Señor. Espero que alguien consiga derribarla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "And at Nav 2, we were able to defeat the Dorkir."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2, conseguimos derrotar la Dorkir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "And at Nav 2, I was able to defeat the Dorkir."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2, conseguí derrotar la Dorkir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "And we were unable to destroy the Dorkir at Nav 2."
msgstr "Y no conseguimos destruir la Dorkir en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "And I was unable to destroy the Dorkir at Nav 2."
msgstr "Y no conseguí destruir la Dorkir en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I was sorry to hear about Hunter's death."
msgstr "Lamento escuchar lo de la muerte de Hunter."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "He died in the line of duty, fighting the enemies of humanity."
msgstr "Murió en el cumplimiento del deber, luchando contra los enemigos de la humanidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$C, your recorder shows you downed $K this round."
msgstr "$C, su caja negra muestra que ha derribado $K esta vez."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "$C, you came up with no kills. None. Zero. Not good, son."
msgstr "$C, ha venido sin ninguna muerte. Nada. Cero. Eso no está bien, hijo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "Hunter fried $L himself."
msgstr "Hunter ha frito $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Hunter was blanked; he came up with no kills. Sloppy, very sloppy."
msgstr "Hunter viene sin nada; ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte. Menuda chapuza."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then he was lost."
msgstr "Además, lo hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Okay, now, since we don't know the status of Goddard..."
msgstr "Vale, aunque no sabemos el estado de Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "... I need to you stay awake and alert. You're still on duty."
msgstr "...quiero que esté despierto y alerta. Todavía está de servicio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "$C, clean up, then I need to see you in my office."
msgstr "$C, vaya a asearse, después necesito verle en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey there, $R $C! Can't offer you anything alcoholic, sorry."
msgstr "¡Hola, $R $C! No le puedo ofrecer nada con alcohol, lo siento."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I heard you'll be flying again today."
msgstr "He oído que hoy volverá a salir otra vez."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Most of the pilots are already in the Briefing Room already."
msgstr "La mayoría de pilotos ya están preparados en la Sala de la Sesión Informativa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I hear there's still no communication out of Goddard."
msgstr "Dicen que todavía no hay comunicaciones salientes de Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "But I'm hoping that the Kilrathi only wiped out the colony's comm satellite, not the colony."
msgstr "Pero espero que los Kilrathi solo destruyeran el satélite de comunicaciones de la colonia, y no la colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "I've got a cousin on Goddard. Zach Siegler. He's a shuttle pilot."
msgstr "Tengo un primo en Goddard. Zach Siegler. Es un piloto de lanzaderas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "And his wife's a Chief Engineer. If you hear 'bout either one of them..."
msgstr "Y su esposa es una Jefa de Ingenieros. Si se entera de algo sobre alguno de ellos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Let me know, and I'll try an' get hold of them myself."
msgstr "...ya me avisará, e intentaré contactar con ellos por mi cuenta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/5/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "But you better get to Briefing right now, $R."
msgstr "Pero será mejor que vaya a la Sesión Informativa ya, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D: Goddard system."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Goddard"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "The Commander is uncharacteristically silent."
msgstr "El Comandante está inusualmente callado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "He studies the papers before him, then speaks quietly."
msgstr "Estudia los documentos que tiene delante suyo, después habla con serenidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "I'm sorry to have to report bad news."
msgstr "Lamento informar de malas noticias."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "The Tiger's Claw arrived too late. The Goddard colony has been completely destroyed."
msgstr "La Garra de Tigre ha llegado demasiado tarde. Han destruido totalmente la Colonia Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "A quarter of a million Terran colonists have been killed."
msgstr "Han muerto un cuarto de millón de colonos Terrestres."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "The briefing room is completely silent."
msgstr "La sala de la sesión informativa se queda totalmente en silencio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "We're still hunting for survivors, but things don't look good."
msgstr "Todavía estamos buscando supervivientes, pero las cosas no pintan bien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "My condolences to any of you with relatives on Goddard."
msgstr "Mis condolencias a todos los que tengan parientes en Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "We've tried to reconstruct what happened there. This is what we know..."
msgstr "Hemos intentado reconstruir lo que ha ocurrido aquí. Esto es lo que sabemos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "According to black-box recordings of radio chatter and comm-sat data..."
msgstr "Según las grabaciones de la caja negra de las conversaciones por radio y los datos del satélite de comunicaciones..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "... the Kilrathi arrived at the colony five hours ago."
msgstr "...los Kilrathi llegaron a la colonia hace cinco horas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "They brought only a small fleet... but they had some kind of new weapon."
msgstr "Solo trajeron una pequeña flota... pero tenían alguna especie de arma nueva."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Our best guess is that this was the first use of a Kilrathi technology."
msgstr "Nuestra mejor conjetura es que esta es la primera vez que se usa tecnología Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Some kind of energy weapon, something that Goddard's orbital emplacements couldn't deflect."
msgstr "Una especie de arma de energía, algo que los emplazamientos orbitales de Goddard no pudieron desviar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "The Kilrathi weapon wiped out the entire colony. Nothing was left."
msgstr "El arma Kilrathi borró del mapa toda la colonia. No ha quedado nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "According to Goddard's comm-sats, a single energy weapon blast registered on their screens."
msgstr "Según los satélites de comunicaciones de Goddard, solo registraron en sus pantallas una única ráfaga del arma de energía."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "That one blast destroyed the colony.  And our current defense systems can't counter it."
msgstr "Esa única ráfaga destruyó la colonia. Y nuestros sistemas de defensa actuales no pudieron hacerle frente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "We don't know whether or not this weapon will be usable against starships, but we can't risk the Kilrathi destroying another colony."
msgstr "No sabemos si este arma se puede usar contra naves estelares, pero no podemos arriesgarnos a que los Kilrathi destruyan otra colonia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "So we've been in jump-space communication with our High Command."
msgstr "Así que hemos estado en comunicación subespacial con nuestro Alto Mando."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "And our orders have just come in. Listen closely."
msgstr "Y nuestras órdenes justo acaban de llegar. Escuchen atentamente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "We are to proceed at all speed after the departed Kilrathi fleet."
msgstr "Vamos a ir a máxima velocidad a por la flota Kilrathi que ha partido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "And we are to destroy their vessels and this new weapon."
msgstr "Y vamos a destruir sus naves y esta nueva arma."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "This means we'll have to FOLLOW their fleet into Kilrathi space..."
msgstr "Esto significa que tendremos que SEGUIR su flota dentro del espacio Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "...keeping a low profile for as long as we can.  Then we'll attack their fleet..."
msgstr "...pasando desapercibidos todo el tiempo que podamos. Entonces atacaremos su flota..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "...and wipe it out completely.  And then get the hell out of there."
msgstr "...y la borraremos del mapa completamente. Después saldremos de aquí cagando leches."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "Furthermore, you may encounter some technical problems as we enter Kilrathi space."
msgstr "Por otro lado, puede que se encuentren algunos problemas técnicos a medida que entramos en el espacio Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "Our lack of accurate star charts will play havoc with your on-board Nav systems."
msgstr "Nuestra falta de mapas estelares precisos causará estragos a nuestros sistemas de Navegación de a bordo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "So don't be surprised if Nav points, asteroids, or minefield information is not accurate on your Nav screen."
msgstr "Así que no se sorprendan si los Puntos Nav, asteroides o campos de minas no son precisos en su pantalla Nav."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "You must fly your assignments diligently. Follow your flight paths to the letter."
msgstr "Deben volar sus asignaciones con esmero. Sigan sus rutas de vuelo al pie de la letra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "All right, these are the mission assignments."
msgstr "Muy bien, estas son las asignaciones de las misiones."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "All wings will launch to escort Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Todas las alas saldrán para escoltar a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "Then you'll fan out to clean enemy ships ahead of us."
msgstr "Después se abrirán en abanico para despejar las naves enemigas que hayan por delante."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "Individual wing assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son las asignaciones de ala individuales..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "The Colonel gives specific orders to each wing, and then..."
msgstr "El coronel proporciona las órdenes específicas de cada ala, y finalmente..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/35"
msgid "Epsilon Wing will be $C and Angel. $C is wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Epsilon estará formada por $C y Angel. $C es el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/36"
msgid "Epsilon Wing will be $C."
msgstr "El Ala Epsilon estará formada por $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/37"
msgid "These are your orders, $R..."
msgstr "Estas son sus órdenes, $R..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/38"
msgid "Once the area around Tiger's Claw is clear, cruise to Nav One."
msgstr "Una vez esté despejada la zona alrededor de la Garra de Tigre, navegue hasta Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/39"
msgid "And when that region is clean, return to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Y cuando esa región esté despejada, vuelva a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/0/record/40"
msgid "Good luck, pilots. Dismissed."
msgstr "Buena suerte, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Good.  You're both alive.  Report, $R."
msgstr "Bien. Los dos están vivos. Informe, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Dammit, we can't afford casualties, not on this mission."
msgstr "Maldita sea, no podemos permitirnos bajas, no en esta misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "...and it would have to be Angel. Report, $R."
msgstr "...y tenía que ser Angel. Informe, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "We couldn't take care of the Fralthi at Nav 1, sir."
msgstr "No pudimos encargarnos de la Fralthi en Nav 1, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I couldn't take care of the Fralthi at Nav 1, sir."
msgstr "No pude encargarme de la Fralthi en Nav 1, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "We encountered a Fralthi at Nav 1. She won't be back, sir."
msgstr "Nos encontramos a una Fralthi en Nav 1. Ya no volverá, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I encountered a Fralthi at Nav 1. She won't be back, sir."
msgstr "Me encontré a una Fralthi en Nav 1. Ya no volverá, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "And Angel...?"
msgstr "¿Y Angel...?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I wish I could've done something to prevent it, sir."
msgstr "Ojalá pudiera haber hecho algo para evitarlo, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "She knew the risks.  Remember that, $R, when you fly your next mission."
msgstr "Conocía los riesgos. Recuérdelo cuando vuele su próxima misión, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "All right. $C, you knocked down $K."
msgstr "Está bien. $C, usted ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "All right. $C, you came up with no kills."
msgstr "Está bien. $C, ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Angel bagged $L."
msgstr "Angel ha cazado $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Angel didn't toast any cats this time."
msgstr "Esta vez Angel no ha frito a ningún gato."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "And then we lost her."
msgstr "Además, la hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Okay. You've got some time to rest before your next mission."
msgstr "Vale. Tiene algo de tiempo para descansar antes de su próxima misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "$C, I need to see you in my office."
msgstr "$C, necesito verle en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$C, I've been hearin' some bad rumors."
msgstr "$C, se están difundiendo algunos rumores feos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "The Search and Rescue teams are back from planetside."
msgstr "Los equipos de Búsqueda y Rescate han vuelto del planeta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "They were only on the ground for a few hours, and now they're not talkin'."
msgstr "Solo estuvieron en tierra unas pocas horas, y ahora no cuentan nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I can't get any answers from the bridge..."
msgstr "No consigo obtener ninguna respuesta del puente..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "... nothing except `Pipe down and do your job.'"
msgstr "...ninguna excepto 'Cállate y haz tu trabajo'."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "And Colonel Halcyon looks like he wants to bite somebody's head off."
msgstr "Y el Coronel Halcyon parece como si quisiera arrancarle la cabeza a alguien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "So if you get any news on what's going on, pass it my way."
msgstr "Así que si se entera de lo que está ocurriendo, pásese por aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "See you later, $C."
msgstr "Nos vemos luego, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. It was very active this morning, non?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. Esta mañana ha sido movidita, ¿non?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "The other wings ran into a horde of Krants and Salthi."
msgstr "Las otras alas se han topado con una horda de Krants y Salthis."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Mon Dieu, what a dogfight!"
msgstr "Mon Dieu, ¡menudo combate aéreo!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I did so many snap-rolls, I'm still dizzy."
msgstr "Hice tantas vueltas de campana que todavía estoy mareado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "$N, I understand that we will be wingmates today."
msgstr "$N, creo que hoy seremos compañeros de ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I shall see you later at the flight deck, $C.  We will give the cats a run for their money, oui?"
msgstr "Ya le veré luego en la cubierta de vuelo, $C. Les daremos a los gatos un repaso, ¿oui?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "$C, it sure has been tense around here lately."
msgstr "$C, seguro que aquí últimamente la cosa ha estado tensa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "All the higher-ups have got their shoulders and teeth clenched."
msgstr "Todos los superiores tenían los hombros y los dientes apretados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "More than usual, I mean."
msgstr "Me refiero a más de lo normal."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I've been a little tense, too. Having some trouble sleeping at night."
msgstr "Yo también he estado algo tenso. No he podido dormir por la noche."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I keep having this dream, over and over again. We're in action against the furbags..."
msgstr "Sigo teniendo el mismo sueño, una y otra vez. Estamos en combate contra los peludos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "And up ahead is the biggest Kilrathi ship I've ever seen."
msgstr "...y justo al frente hay la nave Kilrathi más grande que jamás he visto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "All my guns are gone, my missiles blown, shields at null..."
msgstr "Tengo todos mis cañones inutilizados, los misiles fundidos y el escudo anulado..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "And my hands are shaking, shaking as I pull the throttle..."
msgstr "Y mis manos están temblando, como si apretara el acelerador..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "...'cause all I've got left is a mine in my belly."
msgstr "...porque lo único que me queda es una mina en la tripa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "So I go into a dive, straight at her side...the missiles are exploding like stars around me..."
msgstr "Así que me zambullo, directo hacia ella... los misiles explotan a mi alrededor como si fueran estrellas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "I hit the Kilrathi ship straight on---"
msgstr "Impacto directamente en la nave Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/11"
msgid "---And then I wake up."
msgstr "...y después me despierto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/12"
msgid "I know it's weird, but I can't stop thinking about that dream..."
msgstr "Sé que es raro, pero no dejo de pensar en ese sueño..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/8/scene/4/record/13"
msgid "I think all of us are under a lot of stress right now, non?  But we will survive this, mon ami."
msgstr "Creo que todos nosotros estamos bajo mucho estrés ahora mismo, ¿non? Pero sobreviviremos a esto, mon ami."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D: Heading into Kilrathi Space."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nRumbo al Espacio Kilrathi"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "At the moment, we're cruising deeper into Kilrathi space."
msgstr "En este momento estamos navegando hacia el interior del espacio Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "And we just received a coded, tight-beam message from the High Command."
msgstr "Y justo acabamos de recibir un mensaje subluz codificado del Alto Mando."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "They're sending a convoy to rendezvous with us.  But these ships will appear back at the border..."
msgstr "Envían un convoy para que se reúna con nosotros. Pero esas naves aparecerán más atrás, en la frontera..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "...right where we had our last scrap with the furballs."
msgstr "...justo donde combatimos por última vez con los peludos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "So I'm sending wings to retrieve it."
msgstr "Así que estoy enviando alas para que lo vayan a buscar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "You'll return to that jump-point, destroying any Kilrathi that you encounter."
msgstr "Volverán a aquel punto de salto, destruyendo a cualquier Kilrathi que se encuentren."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "At designated jump-points, you'll rendezvous with the Sleipnir convoy..."
msgstr "En los puntos de salto designados se reunirán con el convoy de Sleipnirs..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "...Drayman-class 'sports carrying a company of marines each."
msgstr "...son transportes de clase Drayman que llevan cada uno una compañía de marines."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "As some of you may know, the Sleipner carries the Reavers..."
msgstr "Como algunos de ustedes ya deben saber, la Sleipnir transporta a los Reavers..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "... a division of elite marine units from the Scandinavian nations of Earth."
msgstr "...una división de equipos de marines de élite de las naciones Escandinavas de la Tierra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "We need all the help we can get out here, people. Don't screw up."
msgstr "Necesitamos toda la ayuda que podamos conseguir, pilotos. No la fastidien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Each wing will escort their convoy to a jump point in Kilrathi territory."
msgstr "Cada ala escoltará a su convoy hasta un punto de salto en territorio Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "After the Reavers jump, then return to Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Después de que salten los Reavers, vuelvan a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "If we're lucky, this mission will bring us an additional benefit."
msgstr "Si tenemos suerte, esta misión nos proporcionará un beneficio adicional."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "The Kilrathi might think that this is only an extensive border attack---"
msgstr "Quizás los Kilrathi piensen que esto solo es un ataque a la extensa frontera..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "---and not realize that we're heading deep into their space."
msgstr "...y no se den cuenta de que nos dirigimos más al interior de su espacio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Okay, individual wing assignments."
msgstr "Muy bien, las asignaciones de las alas individuales."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "He gives the orders for each wing, then..."
msgstr "Informa de las órdenes para cada ala, y finalmente..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Epsilon Wing is $C and Angel."
msgstr "El Ala Epsilon la formarán $C y Angel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Epsilon Wing -- $C, you're flying alone."
msgstr "El Ala Epsilon... $C, volará en solitario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "You'll fly a straight course to the rendezvous point."
msgstr "Volará una ruta directa hasta el punto de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "If you're jumped by any Kilrathi, don't hesitate to destroy them."
msgstr "Si salta algún Kilrathi, no dude en destruirlo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Rendezvous with your convoy at Nav One."
msgstr "Reúnase con su convoy en Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "Escort them back to Nav 2, just this side of the hot zone."
msgstr "Lo escoltará de vuelta hasta Nav 2, justo en esta parte de la zona peligrosa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "When they jump clear, break off and return home."
msgstr "Cuando hayan saltado, se marcha y vuelve a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "The Reavers have their own orders. They're on a 'secret mission' as well."
msgstr "Los Reavers tienen sus propias órdenes. También tienen su 'misión secreta'."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "If they're successful, we'll rendezvous with them later."
msgstr "Si tienen éxito, nos reuniremos con ellos luego."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Glad to see you back, both of you."
msgstr "Me alegro de verles de vuelta a los dos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Glad to see you back, $C."
msgstr "Me alegro de verle de vuelta, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I'm sorry about Angel."
msgstr "Lamento lo de Angel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I just wish there was something I could've done, sir."
msgstr "Ojalá pudiera haber hecho algo para evitarlo, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "She knew the risks.  Remember that, $R, next time you fly a mission."
msgstr "Conocía los riesgos. Recuérdelo cuando vuele su próxima misión, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Listen, quite a few fighters were damaged in this last mission."
msgstr "Escuche, en esta última misión dañaron unos cuantos cazas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "So don't be surprised if you find yourself flying a Scimitar on short notice."
msgstr "Así que no se sorprenda si se encuentra volando con una Scimitar sin previo aviso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Let's review the mission.  Your report, $C."
msgstr "Vamos a revisar la misión. Su informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I headed out to meet the Reaver convoy at the rendezvous point."
msgstr "Me dirigí a reunirme con el convoy de los Reavers en el punto de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "We headed out to meet the Reaver convoy at the rendezvous point."
msgstr "Nos dirigimos a reunirnos con el convoy de los Reavers en el punto de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "It was quite a fight, mon Colonel."
msgstr "Fue una pelea tremenda, mon Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "The entire convoy survived, sir."
msgstr "Todo el convoy ha sobrevivido, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Good work, $C."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "The entire convoy was destroyed. I'm sorry, sir...I did my best."
msgstr "Todo el convoy fue destruido. Lo siento, Señor... hice lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "I lost one of the transports. I'm sorry, sir...I did my best."
msgstr "He perdido uno de los transportes. Lo siento, Señor... hice lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "But at least the other transport survived."
msgstr "Pero al menos el otro transporte sobrevivió."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "I lost one of the transports. I'm sorry, sir...I did my best."
msgstr "He perdido uno de los transportes. Lo siento, Señor... hice lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "But at least the other transport survived."
msgstr "Pero al menos el otro transporte sobrevivió."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "A lot of good soldiers died today because of you, $R."
msgstr "Muchos buenos soldados han muerto hoy por su culpa, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Later, when I've had some time to calm down, we'll discuss this further."
msgstr "Luego, cuando tenga algo de tiempo para calmarme, seguiremos discutiendo esto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "For the record, $C, you killed $K."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, $C, usted ha matado $K."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "For the record, $C, you came up with no kills."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, $C, ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Angel tagged $L."
msgstr "Angel ha cazado $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "Angel didn't kill any this time out."
msgstr "Esta vez Angel no ha matado ninguno."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "And I'll need to see you in my office immediately."
msgstr "Y quiero verle en mi oficina inmediatamente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "That's all. Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo. Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C. Glad you made it back in."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Me alegro de que consiguiera volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "You might want to go talk to Paladin and Knight."
msgstr "Tal vez quiera hablar un rato con Paladín y Knight."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I think they're both a little on the edge."
msgstr "Creo que los dos están un poco al límite."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Let me know if you hear anything else about Goddard, okay?"
msgstr "Avíseme si se entera de algo más de Goddard, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Good morning, $C."
msgstr "Buenos días, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I don't know about you, but I'm starting to get worried about this affair."
msgstr "No sé usted, pero yo estoy empezando a preocuparme sobre este asunto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "You realize we're heading blind as a bat into uncharted enemy space?"
msgstr "¿Se ha dado cuenta de que nos dirigimos ciegamente hacia el espacio enemigo inexplorado?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Going after a Kilrathi super-weapon we know nothing about?"
msgstr "¿Que vamos a por una súper-arma Kilrathi de la que no sabemos nada?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "That's right, $R. Joe here is going to be our morale officer from now on."
msgstr "Así es, $R. A partir de ahora Joe va a ser nuestro oficial de la moral."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "No, thanks... I'd rather fight the Kilrathi!"
msgstr "No, gracias... ¡prefiero luchar con los Kilrathi!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Let me tell you some of my own dark thoughts, kid."
msgstr "Deje que le cuente algunos de mis peores pensamientos, chico."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "I've been watching Maniac.  He says he's been having nightmares..."
msgstr "He estado observando a Maniac. Dice que ha tenido pesadillas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "...and I've seen his hands shaking every time he climbs into the cockpit."
msgstr "...y he visto temblar sus manos cada vez que se sube a una cabina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "I think Todd's losing it.  He's always been on the edge, but this looks real bad."
msgstr "Creo que Todd está perdiendo la cabeza. Siempre ha ido al límite, pero eso pasa factura."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/10"
msgid "I'd keep a close eye on him, if he was my wingman."
msgstr "Si fuera mi copiloto, lo vigilaría de cerca."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/3/record/11"
msgid "Otherwise, that crazy laugh of his might be the last thing you hear."
msgstr "De lo contrario, esa risa loca suya podría ser la última cosa que oyera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Sit yourself down, lad, an' have a drink.  There's a question that's been troublin' me---"
msgstr "Siéntese, muchacho y tome algo. Hay una cuestión que me ha estado preocupando..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "The cats hae shown nae mercy to our people.  But if we win this war, wha' will we do to them?"
msgstr "Los gatos no han mostrado piedad con nuestra gente. Pero si ganamos esta guerra, ¿qué les haremos nosotros a ellos?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "What do you mean, James?"
msgstr "¿De qué estás hablando, James?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Genocide, lad.  If we dinna destroy them completely, this war may never end."
msgstr "Del genocidio, muchacho. Si no los destruimos totalmente, esta guerra nunca terminará."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "An' if we do kill them all, how are we different from them?"
msgstr "Y si los matamos a todos, ¿acaso somos diferentes a ellos?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "If we lose this war, I dinna care what happens, 'cause I won't be alive to see it---"
msgstr "Si perdemos esta guerra, me da igual lo que ocurra, porque no viviré para verlo..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/9/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "...But what if we win?"
msgstr "...¿Pero qué pasa si ganamos?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D: Kilrathi System Code-Named `Midgard.'"
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Kilrathi, Nombre en Clave: 'Midgard'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Good morning. There have been some recent crew reassignments..."
msgstr "Buenos días. Han habido algunos cambios recientes en las asignaciones de la tripulación..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "... and I'd like to welcome all pilots new to the Blue Devil Squadron."
msgstr "...y me gustaría dar la bienvenida a todos los pilotos nuevos del Escuadrón Diablo Azul."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "I hope you like flying the Scimitars. If you don't, I don't want to hear it."
msgstr "Espero que les guste volar en Scimitars. Si no es así, prefiero no saberlo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "And we have some real trouble. The Kilrathi captured a Confederation ship at Goddard..."
msgstr "Y tenemos verdaderos problemas. Los Kilrathi han capturado una nave de la Confederación en Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "...the Falstaff, a Drayman-class courier transport, which is carrying...."
msgstr "...la Falstaff, un transporte de correo de clase Drayman, que llevaba..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...information that is vital in our operations against the Kilrathi."
msgstr "...una información vital para nuestras operaciones contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Weapons design specs, troop movements, tactical maps...that data could cripple our mission."
msgstr "Especificaciones de diseño de armas, movimientos de tropas, mapas tácticos... esos datos podrían paralizar nuestra misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "The cats are familiar with some of our security measures..."
msgstr "Los gatos están familiarizados con algunas de nuestras medidas de seguridad..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "...Such as our rigging of databank couriers to blow when tampered with."
msgstr "...como la de alterar los bancos de datos de los correos para que exploten cuando se manipulan."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Odds are good that they're taking it back to their command center..."
msgstr "Lo más probable es que la estén llevando de vuelta a su centro de mando..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "... so that their own techs can crack it without destroying the ship."
msgstr "...para que sus propios técnicos puedan romper la seguridad sin destruir la nave."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "All right. Today's mission is to destroy that transport."
msgstr "Está bien. La misión de hoy es acabar con ese transporte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Now, we WILL be tipping our hand that we're actively following their fleet."
msgstr "Bien, MOSTRAREMOS nuestras cartas haciéndoles saber que seguimos activamente su flota."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "That's why we'll use a very small task force."
msgstr "Debido a eso, usaremos una pequeña fuerza de ataque."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "With luck, we'll be in and out before they realize they've been hit."
msgstr "Con suerte, entraremos y saldremos antes de que se den cuenta de qué les ha golpeado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Two wings of Blue Devils will be performing the entire mission."
msgstr "Dos alas de los Diablos Azules realizarán toda la misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Here are the individual wing assignments:"
msgstr "Estas son las asignaciones de las alas individuales..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "$C, you and Bossman are Delta Wing. $C is wingleader."
msgstr "$C, usted y Bossman formarán el Ala Delta. $C es el líder de ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "$C, you'll fly alone as Delta Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted volará en solitario formando el Ala Delta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "The commander assigns other wings, then reads Delta's mission:"
msgstr "El comandante asigna las otras alas, después lee la misión de Delta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Head for Nav 1, and destroy any Kilrathi patrols you encounter."
msgstr "Diríjase a Nav 1, y destruya cualquier patrulla Kilrathi que se encuentre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Once you reach Nav 1, your primary objective is to destroy the Falstaff."
msgstr "Una vez llegue a Nav 1, su objetivo primario es destruir la Falstaff."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Afterwards, head for Nav 2.  We've detected a Ralari cruiser there.  Eliminate it."
msgstr "Después, diríjase a Nav 2. Hemos detectado un crucero Ralari allí. Elimínelo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "And keep your eyes open for fighter patrols and escort ships, $C..."
msgstr "Y mantenga los ojos abiertos por si ve patrullas de cazas y naves de escolta, $C..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "...because the Kilrathi will use every ship they have to keep the Falstaff."
msgstr "...porque los Kilrathi usarán todas las naves que tengan para salvaguardar la Falstaff."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "Once we start this, they'll know we're here.  This is our one chance for surprise."
msgstr "Una vez empecemos con esto, sabrán que estamos aquí. Esta es nuestra única posibilidad de sorprenderles."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "Good luck, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Buena suerte, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $R.  Good flying, Bossman?"
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $R. ¿Ha ido bien el vuelo, Bossman?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Not bad, sir."
msgstr "No ha estado mal, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I lost Bossman, sir. I just couldn't---"
msgstr "He perdido a Bossman, Señor. No pude..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I know, $N. But he died honorably, fighting the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Lo sés, $N. Pero murió de forma honorable, luchando contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Tell me what happened."
msgstr "Cuénteme que ha ocurrido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Yes, sir. We launched, and started towards Nav One..."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Salimos y nos dirigimos hacia Nav 1..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "Yes, sir. I launched, and cruised towards Nav One..."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Salí y navegué hacia Nav 1..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "...but we failed to destroy the Drayman."
msgstr "...pero fracasamos destruyendo la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "...but I failed to destroy the Drayman."
msgstr "...pero fracasé destruyendo la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "...where we engaged the enemy, and destroyed the Drayman."
msgstr "...donde atacamos al enemigo y destruimos la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "...where I engaged the enemy, and destroyed the Drayman."
msgstr "...donde ataqué al enemigo y destruí la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "And we met with the Ralari at Nav 2.  It was tough, but she's history, Colonel."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2 nos encontramos con la Ralari. Fue difícil, pero ya es historia, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "And I met with the Ralari at Nav 2.  It was tough, but she's history, Colonel."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2 me encontré con la Ralari. Fue difícil, pero ya es historia, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "And we couldn't stop the Ralari at Nav 2, sir.  This mission was just too difficult."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2 no conseguimos derribar la Ralari, Señor. Esta misión era demasiado difícil."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "And I couldn't stop the Ralari at Nav 2, sir.  This mission was just too difficult."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2 no conseguí derribar la Ralari, Señor. Esta misión era demasiado difícil."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "From the flight recorder, I see that you took out $K Kilrathi ships, $C."
msgstr "Según la caja negra, veo que ha derribado $K Kilrathi, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "$C, you didn't get any of the cats this time.  Not good, son."
msgstr "$C, esta vez no ha acabado con ningún gato. No está bien, hijo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "And Bossman took down $L."
msgstr "Y Bossman derribó $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Bossman didn't stop any of the ships."
msgstr "Bossman no ha conseguido detener a ninguna nave."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "And then the cats killed him.  Damn, but I'm going to miss that man."
msgstr "Además los gatos acabaron con él. Maldita sea, voy a echarle de menos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "I've seen many soldiers die, $R.  But I never get used to it."
msgstr "He visto morir a muchos soldados, $R. Pero nunca me acostumbro a ello."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Good work, $R.  Your success on this mission will make a real difference in this operation."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, $R. Su éxito en esta misión marcará una diferencia de verdad en esta operación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "I know you did your best, $R.  But losing that transport...we're in real trouble now."
msgstr "Sé que hizo lo que pudo, $R. Pero dejando escapar ese transporte... nos sitúa en un buen lío."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "I'll need to see you in my office later, $C."
msgstr "Quiero verle en mi oficina luego, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "What'll you have, $C? I'll set you up with your regular."
msgstr "¿Quiere tomar algo, $C? Le prepararé lo de siempre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Scuttlebutt says that the furbags have a Terran ship with them."
msgstr "Scuttlebutt dice que los peludos tienen una nave Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I know the Kilrathi never take hostages... but maybe just this time..."
msgstr "Sé que los Kilrathi nunca toman rehenes... pero tal vez en este caso..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "No. Who am I kidding? They don't take prisoners. Ever."
msgstr "No. ¿A quién voy a engañar? No hacen prisioneros. Nunca."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "My cousin Zach and his lady are dead as anyone on Goddard..."
msgstr "Mi primo Zach y su esposa están muertos, igual que el resto de Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "... and if the cats do have a captured Confederation ship..."
msgstr "...y si los gatos han capturado una nave de la Confederación..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "You can be sure it's filled with cat food or something. Not prisoners."
msgstr "...le aseguro que está llena de comida para gatos u otras cosas. No de prisioneros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "G'day, $C. I was telling Mariko here how you flew against the furballs."
msgstr "Buen día, $C. Le estaba hablando a Mariko de su vuelo contra los peludos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Hunter was indeed very complimentary of your flying skills."
msgstr "Hunter ha estado halagando sus habilidades de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I hope to fly with you again someday soon."
msgstr "Espero volar con usted de nuevo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Speaking of flying with $C --"
msgstr "Hablando de volar con $C..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "$N, if you get assigned Maniac, be bloody careful."
msgstr "$N, si le asignan a Maniac, vaya con mucho cuidado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "He's been running around the last few days with his head in the clouds."
msgstr "Los últimos días ha estado volando con la cabeza en las nubes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Says he's going to take out the Kilrathi secret weapon that destroyed Goddard, all by himself."
msgstr "Dice que va a acabar con el arma secreta Kilrathi que destruyó Goddard, él solito."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "I get the idea he's got some fantasy of going kamikaze..."
msgstr "Se me ha ocurrido que tiene algún tipo de fantasía como hacer un kamikaze..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "... against the bleedin' Sons of Kilrah."
msgstr "...contra los sangrientos Hijos de Kilrah."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "I don't want to see you flame out because of him.  Be careful, right?"
msgstr "No me gustaría ver que acaba en llamas por culpa de él. Vaya con cuidado, ¿de acuerdo?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Konnichi wa, $C-san."
msgstr "Konichi-wa, $C-san."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I was listening to the newscast this morning."
msgstr "Esta mañana estaba escuchando el telediario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "It appears that there was a Kilrathi attack on Epsilon Station."
msgstr "Por lo visto hubo un ataque Kilrathi en la Estación Epsilon."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "My fiance is stationed there...he is an officer in the Medical Corps."
msgstr "Mi prometido está destinado allí... es un oficial del Cuerpo Médico."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I didn't know that, Mariko."
msgstr "No sabía eso, Mariko."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I rarely speak of him.  It is better to concentrate on our work here."
msgstr "Apenas hablo de él. Es mejor concentrarse en nuestro trabajo aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "For now, we must maintain communications silence, so I cannot find out what has happened."
msgstr "Por ahora, debemos mantener el silencio en las comunicaciones, así que no puedo saber qué ha ocurrido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/12/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "But soon we will return to Terran space, and I will know."
msgstr "Pero pronto volveremos a espacio Terrestre, y ya lo averiguaré."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D: Kilrathi System Code-Named `Midgard.'"
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Kilrathi, Nombre en Clave: 'Midgard'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "The Commander checks his notes, then speaks:"
msgstr "El comandante comprueba las notas, y después habla..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Yesterday's mission, though crucial, tipped off the Kilrathi to our presence."
msgstr "La misión de ayer, aunque era crucial, alertó a los Kilrathi de nuestra presencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "They don't know the size of our fleet, and they can't be sure..."
msgstr "No conocen el tamaño de nuestra flota, y no pueden estar seguros..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "... that we're actually following them. Let's try to keep it that way."
msgstr "...de que realmente les estemos siguiendo. Intentemos que esto siga así."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "Lady Luck is riding with us, though. The Reavers operating in this area... "
msgstr "Parece que la suerte nos acompaña. Los Reavers que operan en esta zona..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...have captured an intact Dralthi class fighter."
msgstr "...han capturado un caza de clase Dralthi intacto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "They're flying her back to the Claw for our techs and intel boys."
msgstr "Lo traen volando hasta la Garra para nuestros técnicos y chicos de inteligencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "There's a lot of Kilrathi tactical data in that ship, pilots."
msgstr "Hay un montón de datos tácticos Kilrathi en esa nave, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "That data could make the difference for us.  I need someone to escort it in."
msgstr "Esos datos podrían marcar una diferencia para nosotros. Necesito que alguien la escolte hasta aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "I know I can do it, Colonel."
msgstr "Yo puedo hacerlo, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Okay.  $C, you're Gamma Wing. Pick your wingman."
msgstr "Muy bien. $C, usted es el Ala Gamma. Elija su copiloto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "I'll fly with Bossman again, sir."
msgstr "Volaré con Bossman otra vez, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "I think that I can handle this one on my own, sir."
msgstr "Creo que puedo apañármelas solo, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Fine. Here's the setup."
msgstr "Bien. Este es el plan."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Head to the rendezvous point via Nav 1."
msgstr "Diríjase al punto de encuentro por Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Nav 2 is your real destination. Make sure there's no danger for our Dralthi fighter..."
msgstr "Nav 2 es su verdadero destino. Compruebe que no hay peligro para nuestro caza Dralthi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "...who will meet you there. Escort him home."
msgstr "...con el que se encontrará allí. Será su escolta de vuelta a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "One thing. Tactical recommends that Nav 1 should be avoided for the trip home."
msgstr "Una cosa. Operaciones recomienda evitar Nav 1 para el viaje de vuelta a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "You are to return by way of Nav 3 and use the asteroids for cover."
msgstr "Tendrá que volver por Nav 3 y usar los asteroides como cobertura."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Good luck, $C. Squadron dismissed."
msgstr "Buena suerte, $C. Escuadrón, retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I'm glad you both made it back."
msgstr "Me alegro de que los dos consiguieran volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "It was tough, sir.  But $C is a good wingleader, much better than he used to be...."
msgstr "Ha sido duro, Señor. Pero $C es un buen líder de ala, mucho mejor de lo que yo solía ser..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I'm glad you made it back alive, $R."
msgstr "Me alegro de que haya vuelto con vida, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I lost Bossman, sir.  I just couldn't---"
msgstr "He perdido a Bossman, Señor. No pude..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I know, $N. But he died honorably, fighting the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Lo sé, $N. Pero murió con honor, luchando contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Let's hear your report, $C."
msgstr "Oigamos su informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "A Ralari was waiting at Nav 1. Scratch one destroyer, sir."
msgstr "Nos estaba esperando una Ralari en Nav 1. Una más destruida y tachada de la lista, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "A Ralari was waiting at Nav 1. Couldn't get the destroyer, sir."
msgstr "Había una Ralari en Nav 1. No fui capaz de acabar con el destructor, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "And we were able to make contact with the captured Dralthi and lead him here."
msgstr "Y conseguimos contactar con la Dralthi capturada y traerla hasta aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "And I was able to make contact with the captured Dralthi and lead him here."
msgstr "Y conseguí contactar con la Dralthi capturada y traerla hasta aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "And we couldn't find the captured Dralthi, Colonel."
msgstr "Y no pudimos encontrar la Dralthi capturada, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "And I couldn't find the captured Dralthi, Colonel."
msgstr "Y no pude encontrar la Dralthi capturada, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "We needed that Dralthi, $N, we needed it very badly."
msgstr "Necesitábamos esa Dralthi, $N, realmente nos hacía mucha falta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "I just hope that we can achieve our mission without that data."
msgstr "Tan solo espero que podamos terminar nuestra misión sin esos datos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "As for your numbers, $C, your log shows you bagged $K."
msgstr "Y respecto sus números, $C, su registro indica que ha cazado $K."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "As for the numbers...you came up empty, $C."
msgstr "Y respecto los números... ha venido sin nada, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "And as usual, Bossman scored. $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Y como es normal, Bossman ha puntuado. $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "And Bossman came up empty."
msgstr "Y Bossman ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then we lost him...he'll be sorely missed."
msgstr "Además lo hemos perdido... lo echaremos de menos profundamente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "$R...drop by my office after you've taken a break."
msgstr "$R... pase por mi oficina después de tomarse un descanso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. Drinks are on the house today."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Hoy invita la casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I don't really have anything much to celebrate, y'see."
msgstr "La verdad es que yo no tengo mucho que celebrar, ¿sabe?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I was holdin' onto this faint hope that my cousin Zach had made it..."
msgstr "Me aferraba a la esperanza de que mi primo Zach lo hubiera conseguido..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "... that somehow he was alive, hiding out on that Drayman."
msgstr "...que de algún modo estaba vivo, ocultándose en esa Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "I knew it wasn't true, but I couldn't stop thinking about it."
msgstr "Sabía que no era verdad, pero no he dejado de darle vueltas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "It was making me crazy, but now I know the truth."
msgstr "Me estaba volviendo loco, pero ahora sé la verdad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "It's all over.  Zach is dead."
msgstr "Todo ha terminado. Zach está muerto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "As dead as everyone else on Goddard.  So the drinks are on me---"
msgstr "Tan muerto como cualquier otro de Goddard. Así que las bebidas corren de mi cuenta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "---until we're all too drunk to think."
msgstr "...hasta que nos hayamos emborrachado para olvidar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Good morning, $C. I've been thinking about the Gwenhyvar..."
msgstr "Buenos días, $C. He estado pensando en la Gwenhyvar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Bossman keeps tellin' that the Phantom Exeter is real."
msgstr "Bossman sigue diciendo que la Exeter Fantasma es real."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "There are a lot of ships who've flown missions and never been heard from again...."
msgstr "Hay un montón de naves que han volado en misiones y nunca se ha sabido nada..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "...with no Kilrathi ships in the area, only our own."
msgstr "...de una nave no Kilrathi en la zona, solo hay las nuestras."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "That's why I think the Gwenhyvar is real..."
msgstr "Por eso creo que la Gwenhyvar es real..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "...and she's out there, somewhere."
msgstr "...y está ahí fuera, en alguna parte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "And I think you're nuts, Boss."
msgstr "Y yo creo que estás chiflado, Boss."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "And you're supposed to be sane, Maniac?"
msgstr "¿Y se supone que tú estás cuerdo, Maniac?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C.  Still alive?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Todavía sigue vivo?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I was certain you were going to die out there today."
msgstr "Tenía la certeza de que hoy iba a morir ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "We're all going to die, you know.  It's just a matter of time."
msgstr "Todos vamos a morir, ¿sabe? Solo es cuestión de tiempo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "But I know I'm being saved for something. Something wonderful."
msgstr "Pero sé que me salvo por algo. Por algo maravilloso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Everyone here teases me because I'm such a hot pilot, and I'm not afraid to say it."
msgstr "Todos los de aquí se burlan de mí porque soy un piloto fanfarrón, y no me da miedo decirlo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "But they'll see.  They'll all see..."
msgstr "Pero ya verán. Todos lo verán..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "...and they'll remember ME as the man who aced the Kilrathi secret weapon."
msgstr "...y ME recordarán como el hombre que se lució con el arma secreta Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/13/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Won't that be great?"
msgstr "¿A que sería estupendo?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Kilrathi-Controlled Space, Code-Named `Jotunheim.'"
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nEspacio bajo Control Kilrathi\nNombre en Clave: 'Jotunheim'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "To start, several of you have been reassigned to Raptors."
msgstr "Para empezar, varios de ustedes han sido asignados a Raptors."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "And here's what's happening now...."
msgstr "Y esto es lo que está ocurriendo ahora..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "The fleet we're following has made an abrupt course change towards an asteroid field."
msgstr "La flota que seguimos ha hecho un repentino cambio de rumbo hacia un campo de asteroides."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We've also received a coded communication from the last surviving Reaver ship."
msgstr "También hemos recibido una comunicación codificada de la última nave superviviente de los Reavers."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "We'll be bringing them home and downloading the data from their ship's log."
msgstr "Los traeremos de vuelta a casa y descargaremos los datos del registro de su nave."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Your mission will be to fly to several Nav points, find the Drayman, and escort her home to the Claw."
msgstr "Su misión será volar a varios Puntos Nav, encontrar la Drayman y escoltarla de vuelta a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Individual wing assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son las asignaciones de alas individuales..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "$C and Spirit, you're Beta Wing."
msgstr "$C y Spirit, formarán el Ala Beta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "$C, you're going to be Beta Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Beta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Spirit, try to keep $C out of trouble, okay?"
msgstr "Spirit, intente alejar a $C de los problemas, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "I will do what I can, Colonel."
msgstr "Haré lo que pueda, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "$C, check out the three Nav points, then return to the Claw.  WITH the Drayman, please."
msgstr "$C, compruebe los tres Puntos Nav, después vuelva a la Garra. CON la Drayman, por favor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "There may be Kilrathi activity at any Nav point...so stay alert."
msgstr "Podría haber actividad Kilrathi en cualquier Punto Nav... así que esté alerta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "The commander explains the other wing assignments."
msgstr "El comandante informa del resto de asignaciones de alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "That's it.  Be careful out there, everyone. Don't get sloppy."
msgstr "Nada más. Vayan todos con cuidado ahí fuera. No se duerman en los laureles."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. Let's hear your report."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. Oigamos su informe."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "We encountered and shot down a Fralthi at Nav 1, sir. I couldn't leave that kind of firepower near us."
msgstr "Nos encontramos y derribamos a una Fralthi en Nav 1, Señor. No podíamos dejar que toda esa potencia de fuego estuviera cerca."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I encountered and shot down a Fralthi at Nav 1, sir. I couldn't leave that kind of firepower near us."
msgstr "Me encontré y derribé a una Fralthi en Nav 1, Señor. No podía dejar que toda esa potencia de fuego estuviera cerca."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "We encountered a Fralthi, Colonel, and tried to ice it without any luck."
msgstr "Nos encontramos a una Fralthi, Coronel, e intentamos acabar con ella, pero no tuvimos suerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I encountered a Fralthi, Colonel, and tried to ice it without any luck."
msgstr "Me encontré a una Fralthi, Coronel, e intenté acabar con ella, pero no tuve suerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And we met with the Drayman at Nav 3. They should be docking with us at any moment."
msgstr "Y nos reunimos con la Drayman en Nav 3. Debería de atracar de un momento a otro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "And I met with the Drayman at Nav 3. They should be docking with us at any moment."
msgstr "Y me reuní con la Drayman en Nav 3. Debería de atracar de un momento a otro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I did my best, sir...but we lost the Drayman."
msgstr "Hice todo lo que pude, Señor... pero perdimos la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I did my best, sir...but I lost the Drayman."
msgstr "Hice todo lo que pude, Señor... pero perdí la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Do you know how many soldiers were on that Drayman, $R?"
msgstr "¿Sabe cuántos soldados habían en esa Drayman, $R?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "After this debriefing, I don't want to see your face for awhile."
msgstr "Después de esta sesión, no quiero verle la cara durante un tiempo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "All right, your flight recorder says that you killed $K, $C."
msgstr "Está bien, su caja negra dice que ha matado $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "The recorder says that you were blanked out there, no kills."
msgstr "La caja negra dice que ha venido sin nada, sin ninguna muerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Spirit came away with $L confirmed Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit regresó con $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Spirit didn't manage to ice any cats this trip."
msgstr "Spirit no consiguió machacar a ningún gato en este viaje."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And then we lost her, damn them all."
msgstr "Además, la hemos perdido, malditos sean."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "I should never have sent her out there, knowing that her mind was on her fiance at Epsilon..."
msgstr "Nunca tendría que haberla enviado ahí fuera, sabiendo que tenía la cabeza en su prometido de Epsilon..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "...and not the battle."
msgstr "...y no en el combate."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Okay, $N, get some rest."
msgstr "Vale, $N, vaya a descansar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "I'll need to see you later, in my office."
msgstr "Quiero verle más tarde, en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hi, $R $C. I'll pour you one of your usual."
msgstr "Hola, $R $C. Le serviré lo de siempre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Looks like you're survivin' this okay."
msgstr "Por lo visto está sobreviviendo a esto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I just keep thinkin', we're so damn alone out here."
msgstr "No dejo de pensar lo condenadamente solos que estamos aquí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "The Tiger's Claw could be destroyed, and no one would ever know what really happened."
msgstr "Podrían destruir la Garra de Tigre, y nadie sabría jamás lo que sucedió realmente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Sorry, $C.  I'm tired, haven't been sleeping much lately.  Let me get that drink for you."
msgstr "Lo siento, $C. Estoy agotado, últimamente no he dormido mucho. Deje que le ponga esa copa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Let me tell you, $C, I have a bad feeling about this campaign."
msgstr "Deje que le diga algo, $C, tengo un mal presentimiento con esta campaña."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "A REAL bad feeling."
msgstr "Un presentimiento REALMENTE malo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Everyone's getting more and more tense, the farther we go into Kilrathi space."
msgstr "A medida que nos adentramos en el espacio Kilrathi, todos están cada vez más tensos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Maniac's not the only one who's getting close to the edge."
msgstr "Maniac no es el único que está llegando al límite."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "And I keep hearing rumors that this is a suicide mission..."
msgstr "Y yo sigo oyendo los rumores diciendo que esta misión es suicida..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "... and that we aren't supposed to make it back."
msgstr "...y supuestamente no vamos a volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Do you think it's true? No, it HAS to be nonsense."
msgstr "¿Usted cree que es cierto? No, SEGURO que son sandeces."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "The Colonel wouldn't do that to us...."
msgstr "El Coronel no nos haría eso..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "...would he?"
msgstr "...¿verdad?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Would you care to join me for a drink, $C?"
msgstr "¿Le importaría unirse a mí para tomar algo, $C?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "There is no more news of Epsilon Station, or my fiance."
msgstr "No hay más noticias de la Estación Epsilon, ni de mi prometido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "But I will not think of that now.  Shotglass believes we may fly in asteroid fields today."
msgstr "Pero ahora no quiero pensar en eso. Shotglass cree que hoy tal vez volemos entre campos de asteroides."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I hope he is right. There is something I wish to try."
msgstr "Espero que tenga razón. Quiero probar una cosa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Have you ever seen Iceman in an asteroid field? No?"
msgstr "¿Ha visto alguna vez a Iceman en un campo de asteroides, no?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "He does some amazing things."
msgstr "Hace unas cosas increíbles."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "If his front shield is gone, he will turn tail..."
msgstr "Si se ha quedado sin escudo frontal, da media vuelta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "... and let his enemy come up behind him."
msgstr "...y deja que el enemigo le persiga."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "He performs evasive maneuvers and uses his thrusters..."
msgstr "Realiza maniobras de evasión y aprieta el acelerador..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "... and sets course straight for a large asteroid."
msgstr "...fijando un rumbo directo hacia un asteroide grande."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "At the last moment possible, he rolls out."
msgstr "En el último momento posible, hace un giro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/11"
msgid "The Kilrathi does not always follow successfully."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi no siempre le siguen con éxito."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/16/scene/4/record/12"
msgid "Of course, Iceman prefers to do this in Hornets or Rapiers, not Raptors."
msgstr "Aunque claro, Iceman prefiere hacer esto en Hornets o Rapiers, no en Raptors."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Kilrathi-Controlled Space, Code-Named 'Jotunheim.'"
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nEspacio bajo Control Kilrathi\nNombre en Clave: 'Jotunheim'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, it's cat-and-mouse time."
msgstr "Pilotos, ha llegado el momento de jugar al gato y al ratón."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "After taking a low, slow, evasive track around the asteroid fields..."
msgstr "Después de seguir un camino lento, evasivo y sigiloso por los campos de asteroides..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "... our quarry has now come up to speed and taken a straight course."
msgstr "...nuestra presa ha alcanzado un ritmo constante y un rumbo directo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We can't think of any reason for this tactic, unless they're leading us into an ambush."
msgstr "No se nos ocurre ningún motivo para una táctica así, a menos que traten de llevarnos a una emboscada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And we're going to follow them, right into their trap."
msgstr "Y nosotros vamos a seguirlos, de lleno a su trampa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "We're doing WHAT, sir?"
msgstr "¿Que vamos a hacer QUE, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "We're going to take the bait, pilots, but on our own terms."
msgstr "Vamos a picar el anzuelo, pilotos, pero bajo nuestros términos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "We're going to launch all fighter wings..."
msgstr "Van a despegar todas las alas de cazas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "...on different routes through the asteroid fields."
msgstr "...hacia diferentes rutas a través de los campos de asteroides."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "...Tactical thinks that the ambush is set up at Nav Three..."
msgstr "...Operaciones cree que han establecido la emboscada en Nav 3..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "The wings will travel via Nav 1 through the asteroids at Nav 2..."
msgstr "Las alas viajarán desde Nav 1 a través de los asteroides hasta Nav 2..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "And ambush the ambush at Nav 3. Destroy them, and return."
msgstr "Y emboscaremos la emboscada en Nav 3. Los destruyen y vuelven."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Wing assignments. Same as last time..."
msgstr "Asignaciones de las alas. Igual que la última vez..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "The Colonel quickly lists off the assignments, including yours:"
msgstr "El coronel enumera rápidamente las asignaciones, incluida la tuya..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Alpha Wing, $C and Spirit."
msgstr "Ala Alpha, $C y Spirit."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "$C, you're on your own this time."
msgstr "$C, esta vez vuela en solitario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Any questions? What is it, Taggart?"
msgstr "¿Alguna pregunta? ¿Qué pasa, Taggart?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Colonel, the other pilots and I think that Maniac is nae fit for duty."
msgstr "Coronel, los otros pilotos y yo creemos que Maniac no es apto para el servicio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Maniac, what do you have to say about that?"
msgstr "Maniac, ¿tiene algo que decir a eso?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Sir, if I can't fly, then I'm nothing.  I'd rather be dead.  Please don't ground me."
msgstr "Señor, si no puedo volar, entonces no soy nada. Preferiría estar muerto. No me deje en tierra, por favor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "All right, get out there and fly. Dismissed."
msgstr "Muy bien, pues. Salga ahí fuera y vuele. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "They're still analyzing your flight recorder data, $C.  But I'd like to hear your report right now."
msgstr "Todavía están analizando los datos de su caja negra, $C. Pero me gustaría oír su informe ahora mismo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "A Dorkir-class communications ship was cruising through Nav 1. It's permanently off the airwaves, sir."
msgstr "Una nave de comunicaciones de clase Dorkir navegaba por Nav 1. Está permanentemente fuera de servicio, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Excellent! That's going to cripple their intelligence reports."
msgstr "¡Excelente! Eso paralizará sus informes de inteligencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "A Dorkir-class ship was cruising through Nav 1, sir, but I'm afraid she escaped."
msgstr "Una nave de clase Dorkir estaba navegando por Nav 1, Señor, pero me temo que consiguió huir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Next, we set our sights on a Fralthi, sir, and took her down."
msgstr "A continuación, fijamos la atención en una Fralthi, Señor, y la derribamos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Next, I set my sights on a Fralthi, sir, and took her down."
msgstr "A continuación, fijé la atención en una Fralthi, Señor, y la derribé."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "And we couldn't bring down the Fralthi, Colonel."
msgstr "Y no pudimos acabar con la Fralthi, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "And I couldn't bring down the Fralthi, Colonel."
msgstr "Y no pude acabar con la Fralthi, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I hope the other wings performed better than you, $R."
msgstr "Espero que las otras alas obtuvieran mejores resultados, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "You had $K recorded kills, $C."
msgstr "El registro muestra que ha matado $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Your flight recorder shows no kills, $R."
msgstr "Su caja negra no muestra ninguna muerte, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Spirit bagged $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit ha cazado $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Spirit didn't toast any Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit no ha frito a ningún Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "And then we lost her, damn them all."
msgstr "Además, la hemos perdido, malditos sean."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "I should never have sent her out there, knowing that her mind was on her fiance at Epsilon..."
msgstr "Nunca tendría que haberla enviado ahí fuera, sabiendo que tenía la cabeza en su prometido de Epsilon..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And not the battle."
msgstr "...y no en el combate."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "All right. Take it easy for a while, both of you."
msgstr "Muy bien. Vayan a relajarse un poco, los dos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "All right. Take it easy for a while."
msgstr "Muy bien. Vaya a relajarse un poco."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then I want to see you in my office, $C."
msgstr "Y después quiero verle en mi oficina, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C. Heard the latest?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Ha oído las últimas noticias?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I haven't heard anything, either.  We've been sitting here for hours an' hours...."
msgstr "Yo tampoco he oído nada. Hemos estado aquí sentados todo el rato..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Just waiting.  It's starting to make me a little crazy.  Some of the pilots, too."
msgstr "...esperando. Me estoy empezando a volver loco. Y algunos de los pilotos también."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I keep tellin' the pilots not to worry, the Colonel knows what he's doing..."
msgstr "Yo les sigo diciendo a los pilotos que no se preocupen, que el coronel sabe lo que hace..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "... but what if he doesn't?"
msgstr "...pero, ¿qué pasa si no es así?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. I heard you saw plenty of action today."
msgstr "Hola, $C. He oído que hoy ha sido un día lleno de acción."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "The Kilrathi are using very smart tactics against us.  I've been recalculating our odds of surviving this mission."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi están usando tácticas muy astutas contra nosotros. He calculado las probabilidades de sobrevivir a esta misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I wish you wouldn't sound so admirin' of 'em, lassie."
msgstr "Ojalá no lo dijera como si los admirara, muchacha."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Their smarts are getting us killed, one by one."
msgstr "Sus astucias nos están matando, uno por uno."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "We may be their enemies, but we cannot ignore their strengths."
msgstr "Puede que seamos sus enemigos, pero no podemos ignorar sus virtudes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "They know this area of space. They are smart and tenacious."
msgstr "Ellos conocen esta zona del espacio. Son audaces y tenaces."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Aye, but the longer we're here, the better we know this part of space."
msgstr "Sí, pero cuanto más tiempo estemos aquí, mejor conoceremos esta parte del espacio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "And we're smart and tenacious, too."
msgstr "Y nosotros también somos audaces y tenaces."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "And we're becomin' just like them.  Just like the Kilrathi...."
msgstr "Y nos estamos volviendo como ellos. Como los Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "But we will survive, Taggart, and that is what matters."
msgstr "Pero nosotros sobreviviremos, Taggart, y eso es lo que cuenta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/3/record/10"
msgid "But we will survive, $C, and that is what matters."
msgstr "Pero nosotros sobreviviremos, $C, y eso es lo que cuenta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Pull up a seat, lad. Have you heard the latest from Tactical?"
msgstr "Tome un asiento, muchacho. ¿Ha oído lo último de Operaciones?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "They've finished their computer analysis of the Kilrathi secret weapon."
msgstr "Han terminado el análisis informático del arma secreta Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "There's nothing we can do to deflect that damned energy blaster---"
msgstr "No hay nada que podamos hacer para desviar esa condenada ráfaga de energía..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "---once they've aimed it at a planet-based colony, but at least---"
msgstr "...una vez apuntan a la colonia de un planeta, pero al menos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "---we'll nae have to worry about them using it against our ships."
msgstr "...no tendremos que preocuparnos de ellos si la quieren usar contra nuestras naves."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Tactical says that the weapon would be useless against fighters or a starship like the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Operaciones dice que el arma sería inútil contra cazas o naves estelares como la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "That we'd be out-of-range before the cats finished priming it."
msgstr "Que estaríamos fuera de su alcance antes de que los gatos acaben pulsando el botón."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "That's a wee bit reassuring, isn't it?"
msgstr "Eso ya tranquiliza un poco, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "Those lads in Tactical are impressive, wi' how they figure these things out on their comp-sims."
msgstr "Los muchachos de Operaciones son impresionantes por cómo se imaginan estas cosas usando los simuladores informáticos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "Of course, their guesses aren't always correct...."
msgstr "Aunque claro, sus suposiciones no siempre son correctas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "Like that time they told us the new Dralthi ships wouldn't have enough range to attack---"
msgstr "Como esa vez que nos dijeron que las nuevas naves Dralthi no tendrían suficiente alcance para atacar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/11"
msgid "---the Epsilon Prima system.  We lost five pilots because of that mistake."
msgstr "...el Sistema Prima Epsilon. Perdimos cinco pilotos por culpa de ese error."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/12"
msgid "Tactical's usually very accurate..."
msgstr "Normalmente los de Operaciones son muy precisos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/17/scene/4/record/13"
msgid "...but I'd nae wager your life on that, laddie."
msgstr "...pero yo no apostaría mi vida en ello, muchacho."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Quiet, everyone.  We have an emergency situation here."
msgstr "Silencio todos. Tenemos una situación de emergencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We've received a distress call from the Johann, an Exeter-class ship---"
msgstr "Hemos recibido una llamada de socorro de la Johann, una nave de clase Exeter..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "---that was attacked by the Kilrathi several hours ago."
msgstr "...que ha sido atacada por los Kilrathi hace varias horas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "They've drifted right into Kilrathi territory.  I need someone to guard them while they complete---"
msgstr "Han ido a la deriva y se han adentrado en territorio Kilrathi. Necesito a alguien que vaya a protegerles mientras terminan..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "---enough repairs so they can reach the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "...algunas reparaciones para que puedan alcanzar la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Unfortunately, I also need most of you here to protect the Claw from another possible ambush."
msgstr "Por desgracia, también les necesito a la gran mayoría aquí para proteger la Garra de otra posible emboscada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "$C and I can take care of this situation, Colonel."
msgstr "$C y yo nos podemos encargar de esta situación, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "I can take care of this situation, Colonel."
msgstr "Yo me puedo encargar de esta situación, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Good.  Here's your mission data...."
msgstr "Bien. Estos son los datos de su misión..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "You'll launch immediately and go to Nav 1."
msgstr "Despegarán de inmediato y volarán hasta Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "If the Johann has drifted past that point, intercept them at Nav 2."
msgstr "Si la Johann ha superado ese punto, la tendrán que interceptar en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Defend them from any Kilrathi in the area while they repair their ship...."
msgstr "La defenderá de cualquier Kilrathi que haya en la zona mientras reparan su nave..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "And then escort them back to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Y después la escoltarán de vuelta hasta la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "The Colonel assigns the other wings to different patrol duties."
msgstr "El coronel asigna tareas diferentes a las otras alas de patrulla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "That's all. Pilots, prepare for launch."
msgstr "Eso es todo. Pilotos, prepárense para despegar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I'm VERY curious to hear your report, $C.  Where is the Johann?  Why in the hell didn't you bring it back?"
msgstr "Tengo MUCHAS ganas de oír su informe, $C. ¿Dónde está la Johann? ¿Por qué narices no la ha traído de vuelta?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "We couldn't get to the Johann, sir.  There were just too many Kilrathi fighters."
msgstr "No pudimos llegar hasta la Johann, Señor. Habían muchísimos cazas Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I couldn't get to the Johann, sir.  There were just too many Kilrathi fighters."
msgstr "No pude llegar hasta la Johann, Señor. Habían muchísimos cazas Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "It wasn't the Johann waiting for us at Nav 2, sir.  It was the Gwenhyvar."
msgstr "La Johann no nos estaba esperando en Nav 2, Señor. Era la Gwenhyvar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "It wasn't the Johann waiting for me at Nav 2, sir.  It was the Gwenhyvar."
msgstr "La Johann no me estaba esperando en Nav 2, Señor. Era la Gwenhyvar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "The Gwenhyvar!  I never thought that story was for real.  What happened, $N?"
msgstr "¡La Gwenhyvar! Nunca pensé que esa historia fuera real. ¿Qué ha ocurrido, $N?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "It was real, sir, and they tried to kill us.  But it's dusted now."
msgstr "Era real, Señor, e intentaron matarnos. Pero ahora es escombros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "It was real, sir, and they tried to kill me.  But it's dusted now."
msgstr "Era real, Señor, e intentó matarme. Pero ahora es escombros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "It is real, sir, and they tried to kill us.  But it escaped...we couldn't destroy it."
msgstr "Es real, Señor, e intentaron matarnos. Pero escapó... no pudimos destruirla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "It is real, sir, and they tried to kill me.  But it escaped...I couldn't destroy it."
msgstr "Es real, Señor, e intentaron matarme. Pero escapó... no pude destruirla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Well, here's your recorder information.  You had $K kills, $C."
msgstr "Bueno, aquí está la información de su caja negra. Ha acabado con $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "You didn't manage any kills, $R."
msgstr "No ha conseguido ninguna muerte, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Spirit bagged $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit ha cazado $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Spirit didn't toast any Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit no dejó frito a ningún Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "And then we lost her, damn them all."
msgstr "Además, la hemos perdido, malditos sean."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "I should never have sent her out there, knowing that her mind was on her fiance at Epsilon..."
msgstr "Nunca tendría que haberla enviado ahí fuera, sabiendo que tenía la cabeza en su prometido de Epsilon..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "And not the battle."
msgstr "...y no en el combate."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Okay, take it easy for a while."
msgstr "Vale, tómese un respiro y descanse."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And I need to see you in my office later, $C."
msgstr "Y luego quiero verle en mi oficina, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/18/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C!  Bar's closed...the Colonel needs every pilot in Briefing, right away."
msgstr "¡Hola, $C!  El Bar está cerrado... el Coronel quiere a todos los pilotos en la Sesión Informativa, ahora mismo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D, somewhere in Kilrathi open space."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nEn algún lugar del espacio abierto Kilrathi"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we have trailed our target to this system."
msgstr "Pilotos, hemos seguido a nuestro objetivo hasta este sistema."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We're not sure of the location of the Kilrathi fleet with the secret weapon, but we know they're in the area."
msgstr "No estamos seguros de la posición de la flota Kilrathi con el arma secreta, pero sabemos que están en la zona."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "The fleet is probably going to call for reinforcements. Probably Fralthi, with destroyer escorts."
msgstr "Es posible que la flota solicite refuerzos. Seguramente serán Fralthis, con una escolta de destructores."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Two Fralthi with additional heavy ships, if they know where to catch us..."
msgstr "Si saben dónde atraparnos, dos Fralthis con naves pesadas adicionales..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "... will reduce Tiger's Claw to molten slag."
msgstr "...convertirían la Garra de Tigre en un montón de escombros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Personally, I'd prefer not to command a slagged ship."
msgstr "Personalmente, yo prefiero no estar al mando de un montón de escombros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "So we're going to have to launch an attack on them very, very soon."
msgstr "Así que tendremos que lanzar un ataque hacia ellos pronto, muy pronto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "We don't know exactly where they are.  But we do have some good data...."
msgstr "No sabemos exactamente dónde se encuentran. Pero tenemos algunos buenos datos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "The ships in this strike fleet were designed to be fast and maneuverable.  Which means they aren't carrying much fuel."
msgstr "Las naves de esa flota de ataque estarán diseñadas para ser rápidas y maniobrables. Lo que indica que no llevarán mucho combustible."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "This means that they're probably headed towards...any guesses, pilots?"
msgstr "Eso significa que probablemente se dirigirán a... ¿alguna idea, pilotos?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "A supply depot, sir?"
msgstr "¿Un depósito de suministros, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Tactical agrees with you on that guess, $C. That's where we think their fleet is headed."
msgstr "Operaciones coincide con su suposición, $C. Ahí es donde creemos que se dirige su flota."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "We're going to get to the supply depot first and take it out."
msgstr "Nosotros iremos antes al depósito de suministros para destruirlo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "You're going to fly scouting missions.  With the information you'll bring back..."
msgstr "Van a volar en misiones de reconocimiento. Con la información que traigan..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "...we should be able to locate the supply depot."
msgstr "...tendríamos que ser capaces de localizar el depósito de suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Here's the setup.  Make sure you scout each of these Nav points."
msgstr "Este es el plan. Asegúrense de explorar cada uno de esos Puntos Nav."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Just follow your mission flight plans; engage the enemy if you find him."
msgstr "Sigan los planes de vuelo de su misión; si se encuentran al enemigo, ataquen."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "But back down from overwhelming opposition. We need the information more than we need a few dead heroes."
msgstr "Pero retrocedan si la oposición es desbordante. Necesitamos más la información que a héroes muertos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "We also have unconfirmed reports of a large ship of an unknown Kilrathi design type."
msgstr "También tenemos informes sin confirmar de una gran nave Kilrathi de diseño desconocido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "This ship will register as a blue target, until we can update your targeting computers."
msgstr "Esta nave se presentará como un objetivo azul, hasta que podamos actualizar sus ordenadores de rastreo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "But it's definitely one of theirs.  Get camera information on it, if you can."
msgstr "Pero definitivamente es de las suyas. Si pueden, obtengan información con la cámara."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "You listen as the commander explains mission assignments."
msgstr "Escuchas mientras el comandante explica las asignaciones de la misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Psi Wing will be $C and Paladin, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Psi la formarán $C y Paladín, con $C como líder de ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "Psi Wing will be $C.  Good luck, $R."
msgstr "El Ala Psi la formará $C. Buena suerte, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "All right, $C. Your report, please."
msgstr "Muy bien, $C. Su informe, por favor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "We had a rough fight at Nav 2, sir, but we took out a Ralari."
msgstr "Tuvimos un combate difícil en Nav 2, Señor, pero acabamos con la Ralari."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I had a rough fight at Nav 2, sir, but I took out a Ralari."
msgstr "Tuve un combate difícil en Nav 2, Señor, pero acabé con la Ralari."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "We couldn't get the Ralari at Nav 2...I recommend that we avoid that area."
msgstr "No pudimos acabar con la Ralari en Nav 2... recomiendo evitar esa zona."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I couldn't get the Ralari at Nav 2...I recommend that we avoid that area."
msgstr "No pude acabar con la Ralari en Nav 2... recomiendo evitar esa zona."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And we couldn't get close enough to any other capital ships to target and log data on them, sir."
msgstr "Y no nos pudimos acercar lo suficiente a ninguna otra nave insignia para fijarla y registrar los datos, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "And I couldn't get close enough to any other capital ships to target and log data on them, sir."
msgstr "Y no me pude acercar lo suficiente a ninguna otra nave insignia para fijarla y registrar los datos, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "At Nav 3, we found another Kilrathi capital ship!  She's huge, sir, bristling with weaponry."
msgstr "En Nav 3, ¡encontramos otra nave insignia Kilrathi! Es enorme, Señor, lleva todo un arsenal."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "At Nav 3, I found another Kilrathi capital ship!  She's huge, sir, bristling with weaponry."
msgstr "En Nav 3, ¡encontré otra nave insignia Kilrathi! Es enorme, Señor, lleva todo un arsenal."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "We tried to destroy her, but were forced to break off and return."
msgstr "Intentamos destruirla, pero nos vimos obligados a retirarnos y volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "I tried to destroy her, but was forced to break off and return."
msgstr "Intenté destruirla, pero me vi obligado a retirarme y volver."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Not bad, $R."
msgstr "No está mal, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "This should help us track down that supply depot.  Good work."
msgstr "Eso tendría que ayudarnos a localizar el depósito de suministros. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "And your numbers show that you bagged $K. Good shooting, son."
msgstr "Y sus números muestran que ha derribado $K. Buena caza, hijo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "The numbers say that you came back with no kills, $R."
msgstr "Los números dicen que ha vuelto sin muertes, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Maybe you need more trainsim time."
msgstr "Quizás necesite más tiempo en el simulador de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "And Paladin bagged $L. Good work."
msgstr "Y Paladín ha cazado $L. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Paladin was blanked. Sloppy work for such a good pilot."
msgstr "Paladín ha vuelto sin nada. Una chapuza de trabajo para un piloto tan bueno."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Sorry about that, sir. I dinna know what happened to me out there."
msgstr "Lo lamento, Señor. No sé qué me ha pasado ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "And he was killed in the fight. Damn...he was so close to retiring."
msgstr "Además lo mataron en combate. Maldita sea... estaba a punto de retirarse."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "I wanted to drink at his retirement party...and see how someone can get out of this damned war alive."
msgstr "Quería brindar por él en su fiesta de jubilación... y ver que alguien sale vivo de esta maldita guerra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Now we'll get the information from your cameras, and see what we can learn from that."
msgstr "Ahora cogeremos la información de sus cámaras, a ver qué averiguamos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "And $C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y $C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$R! Good to see you."
msgstr "¡$R! Me alegro de verle."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I heard about the Gwenhyvar.  I never believed that old story, either."
msgstr "He oído lo de la Gwenhyvar. Yo tampoco me hubiera creído nunca esa vieja historia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Anyhow, you heard the latest news? Grapevine says we lost sight of the enemy ships."
msgstr "En cualquier caso, ¿ha oído las últimas noticias? Un pajarito me ha dicho que hemos perdido de vista las naves enemigas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "They're out there somewhere, and we can't find them."
msgstr "Están ahí fuera, en alguna parte, y no las podemos encontrar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "We fly all this way into Kilrathi space, and lose so many people..."
msgstr "Hemos volado todo este camino adentrándonos en el espacio Kilrathi, y perdido a tanta gente..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "...and for what?  There's no way we can afford to turn back now."
msgstr "...¿para qué? Ahora ya no hay vuelta atrás."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "We'd better find those cats, kill them and get out of here fast---"
msgstr "Será mejor que encontremos a esos gatos, los matemos y salgamos de aquí rápido..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "---or we'll be as dead as my cousin, and the rest of the colonists on Goddard."
msgstr "...o acabaremos muertos igual que mi primo y el resto de colonos de Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "'ello, mate. Seen enough action yet?"
msgstr "Hola compañero. ¿Qué le parece todo este follón?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I was telling the Old Man here that Zeta Wing lost a couple pilots today."
msgstr "Le estaba diciendo al Anciano de aquí que el Ala Zeta hoy ha perdido un par de pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I was telling Shotglass here that Zeta Wing lost a couple pilots today."
msgstr "Le estaba diciendo a Shotglass que el Ala Zeta hoy ha perdido un par de pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "One of them just went bonkers, flew right at a Fralthi---"
msgstr "Uno de ellos se volvió majareta, voló directo hacia una Fralthi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "And went up in an explosion that didn't even dent the side of that catbox lorry."
msgstr "...y acabó con una explosión que ni siquiera abolló el lateral de esa gatera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "If we keep losing pilots, there won't be enough of us to fly..."
msgstr "Si seguimos perdiendo pilotos, no quedaremos muchos para volar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "...and then it'll be over."
msgstr "...y entonces todo habrá acabado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "And I was just tellin' this haggis-brained lad..."
msgstr "Y yo le estaba diciendo a este muchacho sin cerebro..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "That there are a few pilots in our OWN squadron that need new pilots' suits."
msgstr "...que algunos pilotos de nuestro PROPIO escuadrón necesitan trajes nuevos de piloto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "Good white ones, with extra-long sleeves."
msgstr "Unos blancos, que sean buenos y con las mangas extra largas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good to see ye again, lad."
msgstr "Me alegro de verle otra vez, muchacho."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "Listen, do us all a favor, would ye?"
msgstr "Oiga, ¿nos podría hacer un favor?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "A lot of the pilots have been hearin' that we lost the Kilrathi fleet."
msgstr "Muchos pilotos han oído que hemos perdido la flota Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "They're expectin' us to turn tail and run back for Terran space."
msgstr "Esperan que nos rajemos y volvamos corriendo al espacio Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Some of 'em are tickled pink about it."
msgstr "A algunos de ellos les encantaría eso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Some of 'em are thinking about proppin' a gun 'gainst their chin an' pulling the trigger."
msgstr "Otros están pensando en poner una pistola en su sien y apretar el gatillo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "You tell 'em it's all damned foolishness."
msgstr "Dígales que todo eso son estupideces."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Colonel Halcyon is a very canny man, the best in the space navy."
msgstr "El Coronel Halcyon es un hombre muy astuto, el mejor de la marina espacial."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "If anyone can find the Kilrathi, he can."
msgstr "Si alguien puede encontrar a los Kilrathi, es él."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "So if anyone asks you, this is what you should tell them:"
msgstr "Así que si alguien le pregunta, le dice esto:"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/20/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "This operation isn't over, and we haven't lost it yet."
msgstr "Esta operación no ha terminado y todavía no hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "We've got a lot to do and only a little time, so I'll keep this brief."
msgstr "Tenemos mucho que hacer y muy poco tiempo, así que seré breve."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "First, you'll be flying Scimitars...the techs are repairing the other ships."
msgstr "Primero, volarán en Scimitars... los técnicos están reparando las otras naves."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And we've pinpointed the quadrant of the Kilrathi supply depot.  Your mission is simple and strategic..."
msgstr "Y hemos identificado el cuadrante donde está el depósito de suministros Kilrathi. Su misión es sencilla y estratégica..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Go to Nav 1 and Nav 2.  Eliminate any inbound Kilrathi warships..."
msgstr "Vayan a Nav 1 y Nav 2. Eliminen a cualquier nave de guerra Kilrathi entrante..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "Then head for the depot at Nav 3. Destroy it, and return to Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Después se dirigen al depósito en Nav 3. Lo destruyen, y vuelvan a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "But be careful.  You can bet your lives that the depot will be guarded."
msgstr "Pero tengan cuidado. Les apuesto la vida a que el depósito estará protegido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Wing assignments:"
msgstr "Asignaciones de las alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "The Commander lists the other wing teams, then addresses you:"
msgstr "El comandante enumera a los otros equipos de alas, y al final se dirige a ti."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "$C, you and Paladin are Theta Wing again. "
msgstr "$C, usted y Paladín formarán el Ala Theta otra vez."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "$C, you're Theta Wing. I sure wish you had Paladin with you for this one."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Theta. Le aseguro que deseará que Paladín hubiera estado con usted en esta misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "I'll be flying for both of us, sir."
msgstr "Volaré por los dos, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Get ready for immediate launch. Dismissed."
msgstr "Prepárense para despegar de inmediato. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Report, Theta Wing."
msgstr "Informe, Ala Theta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Ran into a Lumbari at Nav 2.  That tanker is dusted, sir."
msgstr "Nos topamos con una Lumbari en Nav 2. El carguero cisterna está hecho trizas, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Couldn't get close enough to the Lumbari at Nav 2...I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "No pude acercarme lo suficiente a la Lumbari en Nav 2... Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "And I couldn't take out that supply depot.  Colonel, I did my best."
msgstr "Y no pude destruir el depósito de suministros. Coronel, hice lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And then I headed for that supply depot."
msgstr "Y después seguí la ruta hacia el depósito de suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "It was tough, sir.  One of the toughest missions I've ever flown."
msgstr "Fue difícil, Señor. Una de las misiones más duras en las que he volado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Enough theatrics, $C...what happened?"
msgstr "Ya basta de tanto drama, $C... ¿qué ocurrió?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "It's history, sir."
msgstr "Es historia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Excellent, $R!  I knew you wouldn't let us down."
msgstr "¡Excelente, $R! Sabía que no nos defraudaría."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "And you nailed $K of those cats."
msgstr "Y usted ha acabado con $K Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "No confirmed Kilrathi kills, $R.  You're usually better than that."
msgstr "No tiene muertes confirmadas Kilrathi, $R. Normalmente lo hace mejor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Paladin took down $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Paladín derribó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Paladin came up with zero."
msgstr "Paladín ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "I did m'best, sir. The Kilrathi were fightin' something fierce out there."
msgstr "Hice lo que pude, Señor. Los Kilrathi lucharon con fiereza ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And then he was killed in the fight. Damn...he was so close to retiring."
msgstr "Además lo mataron en combate. Maldita sea... estaba a punto de retirarse."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "I wanted to drink at his retirement party...and see how someone can get out of this damned war alive."
msgstr "Quería brindar por él en su fiesta de jubilación... y ver que alguien sale vivo de esta maldita guerra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Just so you know...another wing took out the supply depot.  But you should have nailed it yourself, mister."
msgstr "Solo para que lo sepa... otra ala derribó el depósito de suministros. Pero la tendría que haber destruido usted, caballero."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "$C, I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C. Here's your usual."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Aquí tiene lo de siempre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I heard everyone had a rough patrol."
msgstr "He oído que todos han tenido una patrulla difícil."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "But the grapevine says that all that Kilrathi activity..."
msgstr "Pero mi pajarito me ha dicho que toda esa actividad Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "... HAS to mean there's an installation nearby."
msgstr "...DEBE significar que hay cerca una instalación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "If it's not the station we're looking for..."
msgstr "Si no es la estación que estamos buscando..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "... it'll be something else that we can grind into the dust."
msgstr "...será otra cosa que podamos hacer añicos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I want you to nail some of those furballs for me today, $C.  For me, and Zach."
msgstr "Quiero que hoy acabe con algunos de esos peludos de mi parte, $C. De mi parte y de la de Zach."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. Care to sit down?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Le importaría sentarse?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I was just reviewing tactics for attacking capital ships."
msgstr "Tan solo estaba revisando las tácticas para atacar las naves insignia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Ralari, Fralthi, or starbases, it's all the same."
msgstr "Da igual que sean Ralaris, Fralthis o bases estelares. Todas son lo mismo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "If there are defenders, take them out first."
msgstr "Si tienen naves que las defienden, acabe con ellas primero."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "If possible, use only your guns on the defenders."
msgstr "Use solo los cañones con esas naves si es posible."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "Save your missiles for the primary target. You will need them, non?"
msgstr "Guarde los misiles para el objetivo primario. Los va a necesitar, ¿non?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Try it the other way around, and the defenders will eat you alive."
msgstr "Si lo hace al revés, las naves que las defienden se lo comerán vivo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good day, $R $N. Have you come here to cheer me up?"
msgstr "Buenos días, $R $N. ¿Ha venido aquí a animarme?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "The Colonel thinks that I am depressed.  It is not so."
msgstr "El coronel cree que estoy deprimida. No es eso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "We live in uncertain times.  And I have always known that Death walks beside each of us."
msgstr "Vivimos en tiempos inciertos. Y siempre he sabido que la Muerte anda junto a cada uno de nosotros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "But if we destroy the Kilrathi fleet and their secret weapon, I will celebrate."
msgstr "Pero si destruimos la flota Kilrathi y sus armas secretas, lo pienso celebrar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I will get very drunk, and swear quite loudly, and act much like Maniac or Hunter."
msgstr "Me emborracharé hasta la saciedad, gritaré muy alto y actuaré como lo hacen Maniac o Hunter."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "At least for an hour or two."
msgstr "Al menos durante una hora o dos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/21/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Or maybe not. What if my fiance were to learn of such behavior?"
msgstr "O quizás no. ¿Qué pasaría si mi prometido se enterara de que me comporto así?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Site of the Destroyed Kilrathi Supply Depot."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nLugar del Depósito de Suministros Kilrathi destruido"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Two Killer Bees captured a Kilrathi courier ship yesterday, when we were attacking the supply depot."
msgstr "Dos Abejas Asesinas capturaron ayer una nave correo Kilrathi cuando fuimos a atacar el depósito de suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We now have a schematic, less than two days old..."
msgstr "Ahora ya tenemos un programa, de menos de dos días,"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "... of the Kilrathi strike patrol assignments in Vega Sector."
msgstr "de las asignaciones de las patrullas de ataque Kilrathi en el Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "What this means is that if we do manage to get back home safely..."
msgstr "Eso significa que si conseguimos volver a casa sanos y salvos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "... we're going to be able to nail those cats in Vega Sector."
msgstr "...seremos capaces de acabar con esos gatos en el Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "A round of applause and cheers echo through the briefing room."
msgstr "Una ronda de aplausos y hurras resuenan por toda la sala de la sesión informativa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "The other news is that the Bees identified the Kilrathi ship with the secret weapon..."
msgstr "La otra noticia es que las Abejas han identificado la nave Kilrathi con el arma secreta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "...a super-dreadnought, which we've code-named the Sivar."
msgstr "...un súper-acorazado, al cual le hemos dado el nombre en clave Sivar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "This may be the same ship that was sighted by our pilots, not far from our own position."
msgstr "Puede que sea la misma nave que avistaron nuestros pilotos no muy lejos de nuestra posición."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "That ship will be our main target, pilots.  We're going to lure her to this location..."
msgstr "Esa nave será nuestro principal objetivo, pilotos. Vamos a atraerla hasta esta posición..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "And destroy her completely, AND the Kilrathi secret weapon."
msgstr "...y destruirla por completo, JUNTO con el arma secreta Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "But now we need to concentrate on today's mission."
msgstr "Pero ahora debemos concentrarnos en la misión de hoy."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "The Tiger's Claw is now positioned where the base station was."
msgstr "En este momento la Garra de Tigre está ubicada donde estaba el depósito de suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "This means that we're probably going to intercept some incoming ships."
msgstr "Eso quiere decir que seguramente tendremos que interceptar algunas naves entrantes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Now, a lot of them will be short on fuel, or in desperate need of repairs."
msgstr "Muchas de ellas irán cortas de combustible, o necesitarán reparaciones desesperadamente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "But we can't bet that any ship coming in will be an easy kill."
msgstr "Pero no podemos asegurar que todas las naves que vengan sean un objetivo fácil."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "And we can't AFFORD for any of them to tell the Sivar that we're here."
msgstr "Y tampoco nos podemos PERMITIR que ninguna de ellas le cuente a la Sivar que estamos aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "So shoot to kill, pilots. Ignore ALL radio communications from the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Así que disparen a matar, pilotos. Ignoren TODAS las comunicaciones de radio de los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "They can send out an emergency beacon to the Sivar..."
msgstr "Pueden enviar una baliza de emergencia a la Sivar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "... while they stay on the horn with you, pretending to negotiate."
msgstr "...mientras se quedan hablando con ustedes, pretendiendo negociar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "More good news: You've been reassigned to Rapiers for this mission."
msgstr "Más buenas noticias, para esta misión han vuelto a ser asignados a Rapiers."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "About damned time..."
msgstr "Ya iba siendo hora..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "We need our newest, best starfighters for these missions."
msgstr "Necesitamos lo mejor, los mejores cazas estelares para estas misiones."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "Each wing will have an individual assignment; listen for your name."
msgstr "Todas las alas tendrán una asignación individual; escuchen cuando les nombre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "You wait as the Colonel assigns the other wings."
msgstr "Esperas mientras el coronel asigna las otras alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "Sigma Wing will be $C and Iceman, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Sigma la formarán $C y Iceman, con $C como líder de ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "Sigma Wing will be $C, flying solo."
msgstr "El Ala Sigma la formará $C, volando en solitario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "You're running a Comet-Style Patrol mission. Remember those?"
msgstr "Va a llevar a cabo una misión de patrulla de Tipo Cometa. ¿Las recuerda?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "Launch, then move out to 1500 klicks and circle the Tiger's Claw..."
msgstr "Despega, y después se desplaza a 1.500 kilómetros volando en círculos alrededor de la Garra de Tigre..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "... a few times. If you see any cats, attack and destroy."
msgstr "...unas pocas veces. Si ve algún gato, lo ataca y lo destruye."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "When you're sure the area is clear, run out to Nav One."
msgstr "Cuando esté seguro de que la zona está despejada, sale corriendo hacia Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "This area is one of the closest jump points..."
msgstr "Esta zona es una de las que está más cerca de los puntos de salto..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "... and we can expect some incoming Kilrathi to pop up here."
msgstr "...y esperamos que los Kilrathi entrantes aparezcan aquí."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "Shoot over to Nav 2 next, clear it of bogies, and head for Nav 3."
msgstr "A continuación salga disparado hacia Nav 2, lo despeja de enemigos y luego se dirige hacia Nav 3."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/35"
msgid "Once you've eliminated any enemy forces there, return to the Claw."
msgstr "Una vez haya eliminado allí a todas las fuerzas, vuelva a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/36"
msgid "Immediately upon your return, Epsilon will launch and head to Nav One."
msgstr "Inmediatamente después de regresar, saldrá Epsilon y se dirigirá a Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/37"
msgid "In other words, we're doing a constant rotation of wings."
msgstr "En otras palabras, vamos a hacer una rotación constante de alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/38"
msgid "Until we know where the enemy is coming from,these Nav points will be under constant observation."
msgstr "Hasta que no sepamos de dónde viene el enemigo, esos Puntos Nav estarán bajo observación en todo momento."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/0/record/39"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. Report."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. Informe."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. Damned sorry about Iceman.  Tell me what happened."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. Siento mucho lo de Iceman. Cuénteme lo que ha ocurrido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Yes, sir. At Nav 1, I saw a Krant patrol coming in, escorting a pair of tankers."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. En Nav 1, vi una patrulla de Krants entrantes que escoltaban un par de cargueros cisterna."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "From the way they moved, I think they were low on fuel..."
msgstr "Por tal y como se movían, creo que iban escasos de combustible..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "... a routine refueling wing returning from its mission."
msgstr "...era la típica ala que se reabastece después de su misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Both of the tankers are trashed, Colonel."
msgstr "Los dos cargueros cisterna acabaron en cenizas, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I was badly mauled, sir, and didn't kill either of the tankers."
msgstr "Me dañaron gravemente, Señor, y no acabé con ninguno de los cargueros cisterna."

#. English data has misplaced text/test offsets; source taken from testsOffset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "You're kidding! Two poorly defended tankers and you come back blanked."
msgstr "¡No lo dirá en serio! Dos cargueros cisterna mal defendidos y usted vuelve sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "I'm starting to worry about your ability to perform, $C."
msgstr "Me estoy empezando a preocupar de su rendimiento, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Those furballs fought like the devil, sir, but I got one of the Lumbari anyway."
msgstr "Aquellos peludos luchaban como demonios, Señor, pero de todas formas acabé con la Lumbari."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "A Ralari and its Gratha escort were cruising through Nav 2."
msgstr "Una Ralari y su escolta de Grathas hacían su ruta por Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "They had apparently just jumped into the system."
msgstr "Por lo visto acababan de saltar al sistema."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "The Ralari is splashed, sir."
msgstr "He machacado la Ralari, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "I missed the Ralari, sir. Sorry."
msgstr "Perdí la Ralari, Señor. Lo siento."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "The real show, sir, was at Nav 3. A Fralthi-class cruiser was jumping in with a Jalthi escort."
msgstr "Nav 3 era digno de ver. Estaba entrando un crucero de clase Fralthi con su escolta de Jalthis."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "My guess is they were responding to a distress call from the former depot."
msgstr "Supongo que respondían a alguna llamada de socorro del depósito de antes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Those mothers are tough, but that Fralthi is toasted."
msgstr "Esas madrazas son duras, pero freí la Fralthi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "I just couldn't get in enough times to take down the Fralthi, sir. She's still out there."
msgstr "No puede hacer suficientes pasadas como para derribar la Fralthi, Señor. Todavía está ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Wonderful, $C. I'm glad you contained the news of our presence."
msgstr "Maravilloso, $C. Me alegro de que impidiera dar el aviso de nuestra presencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "Now the fleet's likely to continue her present course. Damn good job, mister."
msgstr "Ahora lo más probable es que la flota siga con su rumbo actual. Ha hecho un trabajo condenadamente bueno, caballero."

#. Shortened for the 40px text area with a maximum-length callsign.
msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "This mission was a total failure, $C. I'm glad you contained the news of our presence so well."
msgstr "Esta misión ha sido un fracaso total, $C. Celebro lo bien que ha impedido que avisaran de nuestra presencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Now the fleet's likely to divert to another system.  And I hope you're happy, mister...."
msgstr "Ahora lo más probable es que la flota se desvíe hacia otro sistema. Espero que esté contento, caballero."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Because personally..."
msgstr "Porque personalmente..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "...I'm about ready to send your butt back to Proxima Centauri for good!"
msgstr "...¡estoy a punto de enviar su trasero a Próxima Centauri para siempre!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "Even worse, Iceman was lost. Damned shame."
msgstr "Y lo que es peor, hemos perdido a Iceman. Es una condenada vergüenza."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "We're so close to the Sivar... and he'll never see it."
msgstr "Estamos tan cerca de la Sivar... y él nunca la verá."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/29"
msgid "Your kills totaled $K, $C."
msgstr "El total de muertes suyas es de $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/30"
msgid "At any rate, you didn't kill a single ship. Why do I keep sending you out?"
msgstr "En cualquier caso, no ha acabado con ninguna nave. ¿Por qué lo sigo enviando ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/31"
msgid "Iceman killed $L himself. Good work."
msgstr "Iceman ha matado $L. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/32"
msgid "Iceman was blanked."
msgstr "Iceman ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/33"
msgid "Now, with Iceman gone...I'm going to have to look to you, $C, to blow that damn dreadnought."
msgstr "Además, ahora que ya no está Iceman... dependo de usted para que acabe con ese maldito acorazado, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/34"
msgid "$C, later, see me in my office."
msgstr "$C, venga luego a verme a mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/1/record/35"
msgid "Dismissed!"
msgstr "¡Retírese!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "You pilots really deserve a pat on the back!"
msgstr "¡Ustedes los pilotos deben de estar satisfechos!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Getting that supply station was what everybody needed."
msgstr "Todos necesitábamos que se acabara lo de la estación de suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Have you looked around? Everyone's more alert..."
msgstr "¿Ha mirado a su alrededor? Todos están más alerta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "...walking tall, looking good."
msgstr "...caminan con orgullo y tienen buen aspecto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "I think we were all half-dead until that station went up in flames."
msgstr "Creía que todos estábamos medio muertos, hasta que esa estación estalló."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "Now... now, the pilots have hope. Hope that maybe we can win."
msgstr "Ahora... los pilotos tienen esperanza. La esperanza de que quizás podamos ganar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "That's what they needed. "
msgstr "Es lo que necesitaban."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C! Any bets on which one of us is going to bag the ship with the Kilrathi secret weapon?"
msgstr "¡$C! ¿Alguna apuesta sobre quién de nosotros va a cazar la nave con el arma secreta Kilrathi?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "That'll be something to have on your permanent record."
msgstr "Eso sí que es algo que merece estar presente en el registro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "`So-and-so of Tiger's Claw is credited with the kill..."
msgstr "'A fulanito de tal de la Garra de Tigre se le atribuye la destrucción..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "... of the Kilrathi ship that destroyed Goddard Colony.'"
msgstr "...de la nave Kilrathi que acabó con la Colonia Goddard.'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I just hope that our boys in Tactical get a clean view on the kill."
msgstr "Espero que nuestros chicos de Operaciones cojan una toma limpia de la destrucción."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I'd hate to ship with a carrier-load of pilots..."
msgstr "Odiaría navegar en un portanaves lleno de pilotos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "... all of whom think they'd put in the final missile!"
msgstr "...¡donde todos creen que han sido ellos los que han disparado el último misil!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Sit down, $C."
msgstr "Siéntese, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "It's coming down to the wire."
msgstr "Ya estamos llegando al final."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "The enemy fleet is going to head straight to us now, right into our trap."
msgstr "Ahora la flota enemiga se dirigirá directa hacia nosotros, justo a nuestra trampa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I want that ship with the secret weapon, the one that destroyed Goddard."
msgstr "Quiero la nave con el arma secreta, la que destruyó Goddard."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "If we're wingmates on the strike against that ship..."
msgstr "Si somos copilotos en el ataque contra esa nave..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "... don't get between me and her."
msgstr "...no se interponga entre ella y yo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "That ship is going down, no matter what."
msgstr "Esa nave está acaba, pase lo que pase."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/24/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "No matter what."
msgstr "Pase lo que pase."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Deep in Kilrathi Space."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nEn las profundidades del Espacio Kilrathi"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "We have good news and bad news."
msgstr "Tenemos buenas y malas noticias."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "The good news is, the Sivar is near.  And she's low on fuel...."
msgstr "Las buenas noticias son que la Sivar está cerca. Y le queda poco combustible..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "...because we've tracked and destroyed all of the fuel tankers in this area."
msgstr "...porque la hemos seguido y hemos destruido todos los cargueros cisterna de combustible de la zona."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "So we know she has to be on her way here.  But we won't wait for her."
msgstr "Así que sabemos que debe dirigirse hacia aquí. Pero no la esperaremos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "We're going to saddle up, head back along the Lumbari's course, and find the enemy fleet."
msgstr "Vamos a salir, volver por la ruta de la Lumbari y buscar la flota enemiga."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "They're probably moving; we may have to hunt around a bit."
msgstr "Seguramente se habrán estado moviendo; tal vez tengamos que ir de caza un poco."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "So we're launching all the wings along slightly different courses."
msgstr "Así que vamos a enviar a todas las alas por rutas ligeramente diferentes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "$C! Stay alert. Once again, you're with Iceman, as Mu Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Esté alerta. Irá con Iceman otra vez, en el Ala Mu."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "$C! Stay alert. You're Mu Wing..."
msgstr "¡$C! Esté alerta. Usted será el Ala Mu..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "... and I want you to fly as if Iceman were in your cockpit, in your head."
msgstr "...y quiero que vuele como si Iceman estuviera en su cabina, y en su cabeza."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "No mistakes, cool and cruel. Got that?"
msgstr "No quiero errores, sea frío y despiadado. ¿Lo capta?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Got it, sir."
msgstr "Lo capto, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Launch and cruise to your Nav One. If you meet any Kilrathi on arrival..."
msgstr "Despegue y navegue hasta Nav 1. Si se encuentra con los Kilrathi cuando llegue..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "... dispose of them, and continue to Nav Two. Destroy any cats."
msgstr "...elimínelos, y siga hasta Nav 2. Destruya a todos los gatos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Then head to Nav 3. Get rid of any enemy ships and head for home."
msgstr "Después se dirige a Nav 3. Acabe con cualquier nave enemiga y vuelva a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Your return flight should be via Nav 1. That way you'll avoid the minefields entirely."
msgstr "Su vuelo de regreso puede hacerlo por Nav 1. De esa forma evitará por completo los campos de minas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "If you run into the Sivar, hit your squawk-box and let US know."
msgstr "Si se topa con la Sivar, deles un graznido y ya NOS contará."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Questions? Yes, Angel?"
msgstr "¿Alguna pregunta? ¿Sí, Angel?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Good luck, my friends, and godspeed."
msgstr "Buena suerte, amigos míos y prosperidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "All right, pilots. Let's launch."
msgstr "Está bien, pilotos. Salgamos afuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome home, $C. Skip the fighter count, tell me if you iced any capital ships."
msgstr "Bienvenido a casa, $C. Saltemos la cuenta de cazas, dígame si ha acabado con alguna nave insignia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Yes, sir. Nav One had a loaded Lumbari tanker with a Dralthi escort."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. En Nav 1 había un carguero cisterna lleno de clase Lumbari con una escolta de Dralthis."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Iceman and I iced the Lumbari, sir. She had to be headed for the Sivar, and we couldn't let those supplies get through."
msgstr "Iceman y yo acabamos con la Lumbari, Señor. Debía de dirigirse hacia la Sivar, y no podíamos dejar que esos suministros pasaran."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I iced the Lumbari, sir. She had to be headed for the Sivar, and I couldn't let those supplies get through."
msgstr "Acabé con la Lumbari, Señor. Debía de dirigirse hacia la Sivar, y no podía dejar que esos suministros pasaran."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "The tanker got away, sir. I logged her course, though."
msgstr "El carguero cisterna huyó, Señor. Pero registré su ruta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "O.K. We'll note her course as a possible route to the Sivar."
msgstr "Vale. Anotaremos su rumbo como una ruta posible hasta la Sivar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "And Nav 2 got hot pretty quickly."
msgstr "Y en Nav 2 la cosa se calentó muy rápido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "There was a wing of Jalthi -- and a Dorkir-class transport."
msgstr "Había un ala de Jalthis... y un transporte de clase Dorkir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "The Dorkir was well-guarded...but it's history."
msgstr "La Dorkir estaba bien protegida... pero ya es historia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "The Dorkir was too well-guarded...couldn't get in and take her down."
msgstr "La Dorkir estaba demasiado protegida... no pude acercarme y derribarla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Were there any other ships out there, $R?"
msgstr "¿Habían más naves ahí fuera, $R?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Yes, there was one hell of a reception committee at Nav 3, Colonel."
msgstr "Sí, había un condenado comité de bienvenida en Nav 3, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Krant and Gratha, even a wing of Jalthi nearby...all under the guns of a pair of Fralthi."
msgstr "Eran Krants y Grathas, incluso había cerca un ala de Jalthis... todas bajo la cobertura de un par de Fralthis."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Couldn't get both of the Fralthi, Colonel."
msgstr "No conseguimos acabar con las dos Fralthis, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "BOTH of the Fralthi are toasted, Colonel."
msgstr "Freímos las DOS Fralthis, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "On the way back, I found more Kilrathi ships waiting at Nav 1..."
msgstr "En el camino de vuelta, encontré unas cuantas naves Kilrathi más esperando en Nav 1..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "...a Ralari with Gratha nearby."
msgstr "...una Ralari con Grathas cerca."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "The Ralari is deleted, sir."
msgstr "La Ralari ha sido eliminada, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Had to pass on the Ralari, sir. Didn't have a clean shot for the kill."
msgstr "Tuve que pasar de largo la Ralari, Señor. No conseguí un disparo limpio para acabar con ella."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "The recorder credits you with killing $K, $C."
msgstr "La caja negra le atribuye $K Kilrathi, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "You came up empty, $C. What the hell were you doing out there, mister?"
msgstr "Ha vuelto sin nada, $C. ¿Qué diablos estuvo haciendo ahí fuera, caballero?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "They show Iceman with $L."
msgstr "Los registros muestran que Iceman ha derribado $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "They show Iceman with none."
msgstr "Los registros muestran que Iceman ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "And then the cats killed him...damn, but I never thought that might happen."
msgstr "Además los gatos acabaron con él... maldita sea, nunca pensé que podría ocurrir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "Ice was the perfect fighter, never made a single mistake...until now."
msgstr "Ice era el piloto perfecto, nunca había cometido ni un solo error... hasta ahora."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "That's all, $R. Why don't you hit the showers, take it easy for a while?"
msgstr "Eso es todo, $R. ¿Por qué no se ducha y descansa un rato?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "Oh...and I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Oh... y quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/1/record/29"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Bar's closed, $C. No drinking allowed, Colonel's orders."
msgstr "El Bar está cerrado, $C. No se sirven bebidas, órdenes del Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "He wants everyone at 100 percent, even Paladin."
msgstr "Los quiere a todos al 100 por cien, incluso a Paladín."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "He wants everyone at 100 percent, so I'm takin' a day off."
msgstr "Los quiere a todos al 100 por cien, así que me tomo el día libre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/25/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I'm outta here soon. See you later!"
msgstr "Estoy a punto de irme. ¡Luego nos vemos!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Valgard System."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Valgard"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Listen closely, pilots, because we don't have much time."
msgstr "Escuchen atentamente, porque no tenemos mucho tiempo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Our success against the supply depot has left a large number of Kilrathi fighters without a home base."
msgstr "Nuestro éxito contra el depósito de suministros ha dejado a un gran número de cazas Kilrathi sin una base principal."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Tactical says those ships are heading here.  They'll be very low on fuel...they may try to take the Tiger's Claw intact."
msgstr "Operaciones dice que estas naves se dirigen hacia aquí. Irán cortas de combustible... tal vez intenten capturar la Garra de Tigre intacta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Pilots, you'll stay close to the Tiger's Claw and defend."
msgstr "Pilotos, se quedarán cerca de la Garra de Tigre para defenderla."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "As soon as those ships are destroyed, land immediately.  We'll be jumping from this location...."
msgstr "En cuanto esas naves hayan sido destruidas, aterricen de inmediato. Saltaremos de esta posición..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...before more of these orphaned fighters can arrive."
msgstr "...antes de que puedan llegar más cazas huérfanos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Wing assignments:"
msgstr "Asignaciones de las alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "The Commander lists the other wing teams, then addresses you:"
msgstr "El comandante enumera a los otros equipos de alas, y finalmente se dirige a ti."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "$C, you and Iceman are Mu Wing again. "
msgstr "$C, usted y Iceman formarán de nuevo el Ala Mu."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "$C, you're Mu Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Mu."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Get ready for immediate launch. Dismissed."
msgstr "Prepárense para salir de inmediato. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Glad to see you back alive."
msgstr "Me alegro de ver que ha vuelto con vida."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "The recorder shows you nailed $K of those cats, $R. Good work."
msgstr "La caja negra muestra que ha derribado a $K de los gatos, $R. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "No confirmed Kilrathi kills, $R.  What were you doing out there?"
msgstr "No hay muertes Kilrathi confirmadas, $R. ¿Qué estuvo haciendo ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "And Iceman took down $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Y Iceman ha derribado $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And Iceman came up with zero."
msgstr "Y Iceman ha vuelto sin puntuar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "It was a rough fight out there, Colonel."
msgstr "Fue un combate difícil, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "And then those damned cats killed him.  Ice was the perfect pilot, never made a mistake...until today."
msgstr "Además esos malditos gatos acabaron con él. Ice era el piloto perfecto, nunca había cometido ni un solo error... hasta ahora."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "Well, you'd better get some rest while you can, $C."
msgstr "Bueno, será mejor que descanse un poco mientras pueda, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "And I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C, glad to see you're all right."
msgstr "Hola, $C, me alegro de ver que está bien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I keep hearin' that the situation is bad and gettin' worse...."
msgstr "Siguen diciendo que la situación es mala, y que incluso está empeorando..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I think the stress is getting to everyone."
msgstr "Creo que todos estamos bajo una situación de estrés."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I've seen a lot of off-duty pilots in here, getting drunker than skunks.  And fighting each other..."
msgstr "He visto muchos pilotos fuera de servicio aquí, poniéndose ciegos. Y peleándose entre ellos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Two techs and a pilot tried to kill each other in here, two hours ago."
msgstr "Hace un par de horas, dos técnicos y un piloto intentaron matarse entre ellos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "And some people are just going crazy, like Maniac."
msgstr "Y algunos se están volviendo locos, como Maniac."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I'm tellin' you, if we don't finish off those Kilrathi soon and get out of this place...."
msgstr "¿Sabe?, si no acabamos pronto con esos Kilrathi y nos largamos de este sitio..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "...we might end up killing each other, and save the Kilrathi some work."
msgstr "...nos podríamos acabar matando entre nosotros, y ahorrarles el trabajo a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C!  I am glad to see that you are well."
msgstr "¡$C! Me alegra ver que está bien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I had heard that you were injured on your last mission."
msgstr "Decían que le habían herido en la última misión."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "There are too many rumors floating around this ship.  Mon dieu, some of the stories I have heard!"
msgstr "Hay demasiados rumores circulando en esta nave. Mon dieu, ¡he oído cada historia!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I, for one, cannot believe that this is a suicide mission."
msgstr "Yo no creo que estemos en una misión suicida, por ejemplo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "Soon we will complete this mission, and return to our duties in Vega Sector."
msgstr "Pronto terminaremos esta misión y volveremos a nuestras tareas en el Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C.  I have been sitting here, thinking."
msgstr "Hola, $C. He estado aquí sentada, pensando."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "My fiance...what if he has been captured, like those poor souls aboard the Gwenhyvar?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa si han capturado a mi prometido, como a esas pobres almas a bordo de la Gwenhyvar?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Captured, and forced to betray his own people, over and over again?"
msgstr "¿Los capturan y les obligan a traicionar a su propia gente, una y otra vez?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "It is a fate too horrible to contemplate."
msgstr "Es un destino demasiado horrible que considerar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I will tell you now, if I were to be captured...."
msgstr "Creo que antes de que me capturen..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "...I think I would rather die."
msgstr "...prefiero morir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/26/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Better that than the dishonor and shame of what happened to the Gwenhyvar's crew."
msgstr "Es mejor eso que el deshonor y la vergüenza por la que tuvo que pasar la tripulación de la Gwenhyvar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Unknown sector named 'Vigrid'."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSector desconocido con Nombre en Clave 'Vigrid'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Attention! We need to get everyone on the flightline, fast."
msgstr "¡Atención! Necesitamos a todo el mundo en las lanzaderas, y rápido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Our tactical data has pinpointed the Sivar...and the Kilrathi know where we are."
msgstr "Nuestros datos tácticos han localizado la Sivar... y los Kilrathi saben dónde estamos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "They're sending a massive strike against the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Están enviando un ataque masivo contra la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "It will be all hands on deck..and in space."
msgstr "Que todos vayan al muelle... y al espacio."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "Here's the setup..."
msgstr "Este es el plan..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Sensors show a large strike force massing at Nav 1."
msgstr "Los sensores muestran una enorme fuerza de ataque que se está concentrando en Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Our guess is that they'll have at least one heavy ship, with multiple fighters."
msgstr "Suponemos que al menos tienen una nave pesada con múltiples cazas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Whatever's there, it has to be stopped before it jumps to our position."
msgstr "Sea lo que sea lo que haya allí, hay que detenerlos antes de que salten hasta nuestra posición."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "When you're sure the area is clear, head back to the Claw."
msgstr "Cuando estén seguros de haber despejado la zona, vuelvan a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "$C, you'll have to do this one your own. I can't spare anyone to help you."
msgstr "$C, tendrá que hacer esto en solitario. No tengo a nadie para que le ayude."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "$C and Knight get the duty. Your designation is Omicron Wing."
msgstr "$C y Knight llevarán a cabo esta tarea. Su designación es el Ala Omicron."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "The Colonel assigns all other wings to other jumppoints, forming a shield around the 'Claw."
msgstr "El coronel asigna todas las otras alas a otros puntos de salto, formando un escudo alrededor de la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Questions? All right, then...keep alert, and don't make any mistakes. Dismissed."
msgstr "¿Alguna pregunta? Muy bien, pues... sigan alerta, y no cometan errores. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. Report, and keep it short."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. Informe, y sea breve."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. I've heard about Knight. Give me your report, and keep it short."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. He oído lo de Knight. Deme su informe, y sea breve."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Yes, sir. I launched and ran out to Nav 1 to engage the strike force."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Despegué y volé hasta Nav 1 para enfrentarme a la fuerza de ataque."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "When I first arrived, it didn't seem all that bad...just a Ralari with Jalthi."
msgstr "Nada más llegar, la situación no era tan mala... tan solo había una Ralari con unas Jalthis."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I should have guessed that another wing was on its way in."
msgstr "Tendría que haber imaginado que tenían de camino otra ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Fine. Did you trash the Ralari or not?"
msgstr "Bien. ¿Acabó con la Ralari o no?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "Yes, sir, I did."
msgstr "Sí, Señor, lo hice."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "No, sir, I didn't."
msgstr "No, Señor, no lo hice."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I see. Just so you know, I diverted Maniac and Beta Wing to fix your mistake."
msgstr "Ya veo. Pues para que lo sepa, he desviado a Maniac y al Ala Beta para que corrijan su error."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "No need to discuss the fighters outside, $C. Between you and our gunners, they're history."
msgstr "No hace falta que diga nada sobre los cazas de ahí fuera, $C. Los que habían entre usted y nuestros cañoneros, son historia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "For the record, you killed $K."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, ha matado $K."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "You struck out, $R...no kills."
msgstr "Ha vuelto sin nada, $R... sin ninguna muerte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Knight got $L himself."
msgstr "Knight ha cazado $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Knight got none...not his usual numbers."
msgstr "Knight no tiene ninguno... no es normal en él."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Okay, $C, I want to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Está bien, $C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Dismissed!"
msgstr "¡Retírese!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "You look like you're havin' a good day, $C."
msgstr "Hoy parece que está contento, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "'Course, knowing that the Sivar is sitting out there, running out of power...well, it helps."
msgstr "Aunque claro, saber que la Sivar está plantada ahí fuera, quedándose sin energía... bueno, ayuda."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Scuttlebutt has it that we're just about ready to go for the kill."
msgstr "Scuttlebutt cree que estamos casi listos para acabar con ella."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I hope that we get that shot soon...for Zach and Trisha."
msgstr "Espero que pronto tengamos la oportunidad... por Zach y Trisha."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Ah, but waiting's always the worst part...Bottoms up, $C."
msgstr "Ah, pero la espera siempre es la peor parte... Brindemos, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C. I heard that you just got assigned to the Black Lion squadron."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Dicen que acaban de asignarle al escuadrón León Negro."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "That means you'll be flying with me.  Let's be careful out there, okay?"
msgstr "Eso quiere decir que volará conmigo. Vayamos con cuidado ahí fuera, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Well, I just hope that we're going after that dreadnought soon."
msgstr "Bueno, espero que pronto vayamos a por ese acorazado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "We're so deep into enemy territory, so far from our own lines..."
msgstr "Estamos tan adentro del territorio enemigo, tan lejos de nuestras propias filas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "...the Sivar's not the only one who can't resupply."
msgstr "...la Sivar no es la única que no se puede reabastecer."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good job out there against the furballs, kid."
msgstr "Buen trabajo ahí fuera contra los peludos, chico."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "We'll go for the big one, real soon now."
msgstr "Iremos a por el pez gordo muy pronto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Remember missiles.  Don't use 'em up too fast, kid."
msgstr "Recuerde los misiles. No los use demasiado pronto, chico."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Your guns will sting, and take out the smaller targets for you..."
msgstr "Los cañones también cuentan, y acabarán con los objetivos más pequeños sin problemas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/28/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "..but there's nothing like a missile to finish the job."
msgstr "...pero no hay nada como un misil para terminar el trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Unknown sector named 'Vigrid'."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSector desconocido con Nombre en Clave 'Vigrid'"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Everyone present? Good."
msgstr "¿Están todos presentes? Bien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We're now ready to go after the Sivar."
msgstr "Ya estamos preparados para ir a por la Sivar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "This is the best shot we'll get at her, so let's make it count."
msgstr "Esta es la mejor oportunidad para llegar a ella, así que espero que merezca la pena."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "I've had difficulty deciding which pilot I should send first..."
msgstr "He tenido dificultades en decidir qué pilotos envío primero..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "...because they're likely to meet the greatest resistance."
msgstr "...porque probablemente se encontrarán con la mayor resistencia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "After our first strike launches, the Claw will move to a new vantage point..."
msgstr "Después de lanzar nuestro primer ataque, la Garra se moverá a un nuevo punto más ventajoso..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "...where we will launch the remaining wings."
msgstr "...desde el que saldrán el resto de alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "With any luck, the Sivar won't expect attack from two separate vectors."
msgstr "Con un poco de suerte, la Sivar no esperará un ataque desde dos vectores separados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "All through this mission, the Sivar's been escorted by a substantial fleet."
msgstr "Durante toda esta misión, la Sivar ha estado escoltada por una flota considerable."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "We've picked off that fleet, ship by ship...."
msgstr "Hemos ido interceptando esa flota, nave tras nave..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "But we can't be sure we've nailed all of them. So be VERY careful out there."
msgstr "Pero no podemos estar seguros de haber acabado con todas ellas. Así que vayan con MUCHO cuidado ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Now, listen up. We've lost a lot of good people, during this operation..."
msgstr "Ahora escuchen. Hemos perdido a mucha buena gente durante esta operación..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "...I don't want to lose any more. On this mission---"
msgstr "...y no quiero perder a nadie más. En esta misión..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Hunter, none of this is personal. Keep it on a business level."
msgstr "Hunter, nada de esto es personal. Solo son negocios."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "If you say so, sir."
msgstr "Si usted lo dice, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Angel, give 'em hell... but don't accept any in kind."
msgstr "Angel, deles duro... pero no acepte nada de lo que le den."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Je comprends, mon colonel."
msgstr "Je comprends, mon coronel."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Maniac, I want you stay alive during this one.  I know about your nightmares---"
msgstr "Maniac, quiero que sobreviva a esto. Sé lo de sus pesadillas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "But, sir---"
msgstr "Pero, Señor..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "They're just dreams, kid. This is what's real. And I need you alive, to fight the cats again.  Understand?"
msgstr "Solo son sueños, chico. Esto es la realidad. Y le necesito vivo para volver a luchar con los gatos. ¿Entendido?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "¡Sí, Señor!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Bossman, stay cautious... just don't be TOO cautious."
msgstr "Bossman, vaya con cautela... pero no con DEMASIADA cautela."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "No problem, sir."
msgstr "No hay problema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "Knight, you've always been a pro. Don't get sloppy now."
msgstr "Knight, usted siempre ha sito un veterano. Ahora no se duerma en los laureles."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "I'm on-line and up to speed, sir."
msgstr "Estoy enchufado y al día, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "Spirit, if you harbor any romantic notions about self-sacrifice---"
msgstr "Spirit, si alberga alguna idea romántica sobre el autosacrificio..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "No, sir. Anything I sacrifice today will bear fur and whiskers."
msgstr "No, Señor. Lo único que sacrificaré hoy serán pieles de oso y bigotes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "Glad to hear it."
msgstr "Me alegro de oír eso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "Paladin, flying a desk IS better than breathing vacuum.  Just trust me on that one, okay?"
msgstr "Paladín, trabajar en un escritorio ES mejor que respirar el vacío. ¿Hágame caso por esta vez, vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "Are you just sayin' that so you can get drunk at my retirement party, sir?"
msgstr "¿Dice eso para poderse emborrachar en mi fiesta de jubilación, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "Iceman... uh... just do what you always do."
msgstr "Iceman... em... tan solo haga lo que siempre hace."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "Forget the goodbyes, sir. Let's get this show on the road."
msgstr "Olvídese de las despedidas, Señor. Empecemos de una vez."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "$C, no astrobatics, nothing fancy. Do the job and get out of there alive."
msgstr "$C, no haga astrobacias, ni nada caprichoso. Haga el trabajo y salga de allí vivo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "Aye, aye, sir."
msgstr "Sí, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/35"
msgid "You consider what the Commander said."
msgstr "Piensas en lo que ha dicho el Comandante."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/36"
msgid "He was saying goodbye to the pilots... just in case."
msgstr "Estaba despidiéndose de los pilotos... por si acaso."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/37"
msgid "$C! You're teamed with Knight again, as Omega Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Volverá a formar equipo con Knight, en el Ala Omega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/38"
msgid "$C! You're Omega Wing. Now that we've lost Knight..."
msgstr "¡$C! Usted es el Ala Omega. Ahora que hemos perdido a Knight..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/39"
msgid "... I'm counting on you to come through for us."
msgstr "...no nos falle, cuento con usted."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/40"
msgid "I won't let you down, sir."
msgstr "No le decepcionaré, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/41"
msgid "Here's the scenario."
msgstr "Este es el escenario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/42"
msgid "Head first to Nav 1. Try to destroy any of the remaining support fleet."
msgstr "Diríjase primero a Nav 1. Intente destruir lo que quede de la flota de apoyo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/43"
msgid "They are NOT your main objective, though...that's the Sivar, at Nav Two."
msgstr "Pero ese NO es su principal objetivo... es la Sivar, en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/44"
msgid "If you are able to destroy the Sivar, hit your afterburners and come home."
msgstr "Si es capaz de destruir la Sivar, apriete los postquemadores y vuelva a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/45"
msgid "Rendezvous with the Tiger's Claw at Nav 3."
msgstr "Reúnase con la Garra de Tigre en Nav 3."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/46"
msgid "Questions? No? Good luck, $C. We'll see you at Nav 3."
msgstr "¿Alguna pregunta? ¿No? Buena suerte, $C. Le veré en Nav 3."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/0/record/47"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "We've got the kill on record, $C. Congratulations."
msgstr "Tenemos la destrucción de la nave en el registro, $C. Felicidades."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Personally, I knew that you'd come through for us."
msgstr "Personalmente, sabía que no nos fallaría."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I will see to it that Confederation High Command rewards you for this."
msgstr "Me ocuparé de que el Alto Mando de la Confederación le condecore por esto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "No kill, $C. And the Sivar's sure to have reinforcements and supply coming in."
msgstr "No ha destruido ninguna nave, $C. Y la Sivar seguro que recibe refuerzos y suministros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "So we're bugging out, and bugging out empty."
msgstr "Así que nos marchamos... con las manos vacías."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "After all this time, all the pilots who died... we're running away."
msgstr "Después de todo este tiempo, y de todos los pilotos que han muerto... huimos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "What do you have to add to the report?"
msgstr "¿Qué tiene que añadir al informe?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Not much, sir."
msgstr "No mucho, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "The Sivar had a strong fighter escort. My guess is that the heavier ships ..."
msgstr "La Sivar tenía una fuerte escolta de cazas. Creo que las naves más pesadas..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "... have already maneuvered out of system."
msgstr "...ya han maniobrado para salir del sistema."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Maybe they thought they could intercept the Tiger's Claw and prevent our strike."
msgstr "Tal vez hayan pensado que podrían interceptar a la Garra de Tigre y evitar nuestro ataque."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Like the Fralthi at Nav 1...that ship is dusted, sir."
msgstr "Como la Fralthi en Nav 1... esa nave es cenizas, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "But the Sivar still had a wing of Krant, Jalthi, and Gratha on ready-five."
msgstr "Pero la Sivar todavía tenía un ala de Krants, Jalthis y Grathas en alerta."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "The recorder shows you with killing $K, $C."
msgstr "La caja negra muestra que ha matado $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "The recorder shows you with no kills, $C."
msgstr "La caja negra muestra que ha vuelto sin nada, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "It shows Knight with $L."
msgstr "Muestra que Knight tiene $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "It shows Knight with none."
msgstr "Muestra que Knight ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "And Khumalo died in this battle..."
msgstr "Además Khumalo ha muerto en este combate..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "I'm going to miss that man."
msgstr "Echaré de menos a ese hombre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Yes, sir. But I managed to bag the Sivar..."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Pero he conseguido cazar la Sivar..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "Compared to that... nothing else matters much, does it?"
msgstr "Comparado con eso... todo lo demás no importa, ¿verdad?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Damn right, $C. You've struck a fatal blow to their plans for conquering humanity."
msgstr "Tiene toda la razón, $C. Ha asestado el golpe de gracia a sus planes para conquistar la humanidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Yes, sir...I just wish I could've iced the Sivar."
msgstr "Sí, Señor... ojalá hubiera podido acabar con la Sivar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "None of the other wings were able to take her down either, $C."
msgstr "Ninguna de las otras alas ha sido capaz de derribarla tampoco, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "This operation has been tough, and painful.  We've lost too many friends and allies."
msgstr "Esta operación ha sido dura, y dolorosa. Hemos perdido a muchos amigos y aliados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "Now it's time to go home."
msgstr "Ahora ya es hora de volver a casa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "I'll need to see you in my office later, $C."
msgstr "Quiero verle luego en mi oficina, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "But for now... Dismissed."
msgstr "Pero por ahora... Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey there, $C! Hurry up and get to the Briefing Hall."
msgstr "¡Buenas, $C! Dese prisa y vaya a la Sala de la Sesión Informativa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "It's time to finish this pleasure cruise, one way or the other."
msgstr "Es el momento de poner fin a este crucero de placer, sea como sea."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Best of luck to you, $R $N!"
msgstr "¡Le deseo toda la suerte del mundo, $R $N!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Good day, $C. I'm glad to talk to someone besides our resident lunatics."
msgstr "Buenos días, $C. Me alegro de hablar con alguien a parte de nuestros residentes pirados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I've been writing a letter home...just in case we don't make it back."
msgstr "He estado escribiendo una carta a casa... por si no volvemos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Have you seen the latest holopics of my family, $C?"
msgstr "¿Ha visto las últimas holoimágenes de mi familia, $C?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "No, Boss...can't say that I have."
msgstr "No, Boss... no las he visto."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I'd like to show them to you later.  I miss them very much."
msgstr "Me gustaría enseñárselas luego. Les echo mucho de menos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I hope that this mission ends soon, so we can return to Vega."
msgstr "Espero que esta misión termine pronto, para poder volver a Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hey there, $C. I'm sure that I'll be flying against the Sivar soon."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Seguro que pronto estaré volando contra la Sivar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "In case I don't succeed...you'll have to take out that ship for me."
msgstr "Si yo no tengo éxito... tendrá que acabar con esa nave de mi parte."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "I know that I'll be the one to do it.  Just like in my dream..."
msgstr "Sé que seré yo el que lo haga. Igual que en mi sueño..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "But if I die too quickly, then it's up to you, $C."
msgstr "Pero si muero demasiado rápido, entonces dependerá de usted, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Use your missiles first.  But if nothing else works, I want you to hit them at ramming speed."
msgstr "Primero use sus misiles. Y si no acaba funcionando nada más, quiero que se dirija a ellos a máxima velocidad."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/29/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Just in case, y'know?"
msgstr "Solo por si acaso, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Retreating from Kilrathi Territory"
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nRetirada del Territorio Kilrathi"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, everyone. Listen up and listen good."
msgstr "Atención todos. Escúchenme bien."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "As you know, our failure to achieve success against the Kilrathi..."
msgstr "Como ya saben, nuestro fracaso de triunfar contra los Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "...has necessitated our withdrawal from Kilrathi space."
msgstr "...ha obligado a que nos retiremos del espacio Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We have to assume that the Kilrathi will pursue and attempt to destroy us."
msgstr "Debemos asumir que nos perseguirán e intentarán destruirnos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "The most likely scenario involves a strike against the Claw near the border."
msgstr "El escenario más probable entraña un ataque contra la Garra cerca de la frontera."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "This gives them the most time to prepare for our arrival."
msgstr "Esto les ofrece más tiempo para preparase ante nuestra llegada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "If we can disrupt their scouts enough, we just might avoid their main retaliatory forces."
msgstr "Si podemos obstaculizar lo suficiente a sus exploradores, podríamos evitar sus principales fuerzas de represalia."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Okay, here's your assignments."
msgstr "Bien, estas son sus asignacioness."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "You'll fly to each of the three Nav points."
msgstr "Volarán a cada uno de los tres Puntos Nav..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "...with the goal of destroying any Kilrathi you encounter."
msgstr "...con el objetivo de destruir a cualquier Kilrathi con el que se encuentren."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Remember, this is our only plan to get us out alive."
msgstr "Recuerden, este es nuestro único plan para salir de aquí con vida."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "You wait until your name is called."
msgstr "Esperas hasta que pronuncia tu nombre."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Iota Wing will be $C and Maniac, $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Iota la formarán $C y Maniac, $C será el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Iota Wing will be $C. You'll have to fly alone this run."
msgstr "El Ala Iota la formará $C. Esta carrera la tendrá que volar en solitario."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "That's everyone. Stay sharp, people."
msgstr "Ya están todos. Estén alerta, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Okay, $C. Let's hear it."
msgstr "Muy bien, $C. Oigamos lo que tiene que decir."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Yes, sir. The run out to Nav One was uneventful..."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Desde la salida hasta Nav 1 todo ha estado tranquilo..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "...but once I arrived, there was a wing of Krant escorting a Fralthi, heading for the Claw."
msgstr "...pero una vez he llegado, había un ala de Krants escoltando una Fralthi, en dirección a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Obviously you made it back...how'd you do?"
msgstr "Obviamente ha regresado... ¿cómo le ha ido?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Toasted the Fralthi, sir."
msgstr "Freí la Fralthi, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I fought as hard as I could, Colonel, but didn't kill the Fralthi."
msgstr "Luché todo lo que pude, Coronel, pero no acabé con la Fralthi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I did what damage I could to the fighters before breaking off."
msgstr "Hice todo el daño que pude a los cazas antes de marcharme."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "At Nav Two, there were a mass of Dralthi. I counted ten at least."
msgstr "En Nav 2, había una concentración de Dralthis. Al menos conté diez."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "I killed as many as I could, then headed on."
msgstr "Acabé con todas las que pude, y después seguí adelante."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Understood, $C. Go on."
msgstr "Entendido, $C. Continúe."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Yes, sir. I went for Nav 3 next..."
msgstr "Sí, Señor. A continuación fui a Nav 3..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "...and when I got there, there were two Ralari with Gratha wings on patrol."
msgstr "...y cuando llegué, habían dos Ralaris con alas de Grathas patrullando."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "The first Ralari wasn't too difficult to take out, sir."
msgstr "La primera Ralari no fue demasiado difícil de derribar, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "The damn Gratha kept me from taking the first destroyer out, sir."
msgstr "Las malditas Grathas impidieron que derribara el primer destructor, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And the second Ralari is dusted, sir. No problem."
msgstr "Y la segunda Ralari es cenizas, Señor. Sin problemas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "I didn't kill the second Ralari, Colonel. She's still operational."
msgstr "No acabé con la segunda Ralari, Coronel. Todavía es opertiva."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "OK, $C. I'll see that the other wings take out what you missed."
msgstr "Vale, $C. Haré que las otras alas acaben con lo que se ha dejado."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "The numbers for you are as follows: $K bagged by you..."
msgstr "Sus números muestran que ha cazado $K..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "The numbers for you are as follows: None bagged by you, $C..."
msgstr "Sus números muestran que no ha cazado a ninguno, $C..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "...and Maniac got $L."
msgstr "...y Maniac lo hizo con $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "...and Maniac was blanked. I'm surprised."
msgstr "...y Maniac a vuelto sin nada. Estoy sorprendido."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "And Marshall...I had hopes for that kid.  At least you're still alive, $R."
msgstr "Y Marshall... bueno, aún tenía esperanzas con ese chaval. Al menos usted todavía está vivo, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "$C, I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$C! How's it goin'?"
msgstr "¡$C! ¿Qué tal todo?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I can't believe we're pullin' out. We never finished our job."
msgstr "No me puedo creer que nos marchemos. No hemos terminado el trabajo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "We're just letting the people at Goddard die for nothing. NOTHING!"
msgstr "Tan solo hemos dejado que la gente de Goddard muriera por nada. ¡POR NADA!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Old Man Halcyon better not walk through here...I'd tell him to..."
msgstr "Será mejor que el viejo Halcyon no venga por aquí... o le cantaré las cuarenta..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "...oh, what's the use? We did all we could to win."
msgstr "...oh, ¿y de qué servirá? Hemos hecho todo lo que hemos podido para ganar."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "I just hate losing to those fleabags."
msgstr "Pero odio perder ante esas bolas de pelo."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Bonjour, $C. I am very upset about our defeat."
msgstr "Bonjour, $C. Estoy muy disgustada por nuestra derrota."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Up to this point, we had been pressing the attack..."
msgstr "Hasta este momento siempre habíamos presionado atacando..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "...and now we run like frightened children."
msgstr "...y ahora salimos corriendo como niños asustados."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I have spoken with the Colonel about our chances of surviving our retreat."
msgstr "He hablado con el Coronel sobre las posibilidades de sobrevivir a la retirada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "And the odds do not favor us. Mon Dieu, I have never felt so helpless."
msgstr "Y la suerte está en nuestra contra. Mon Dieu, nunca me he sentido tan impotente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I only wish that I had done more to help our chances."
msgstr "Ojalá hubiera hecho más para ayudar a nuestras posibilidades."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. Will you join me?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Se une a mí?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I am trying to console Jeanette, but she is most adamant in her anger."
msgstr "Estoy tratando de consolar a Jeannette, pero sigue estando furiosa."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Everywhere I go, there is only talk of failure and defeat."
msgstr "Vayamos donde vayamos, solo se habla del fracaso de la derrota."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "We have not lost the war yet, only this one operation has failed."
msgstr "Todavía no hemos perdido la guerra, tan solo esta operación."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I cannot believe that we will bow our heads to the Kilrathi ever."
msgstr "No me puedo creer que nos inclinemos para siempre ante los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/32/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Keep that close to your heart, $C. It will give you inner strength."
msgstr "Que eso quede marcado en su corazón, $C. Le dará fuerza interior."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Nearing the Kilrathi/Terran Border."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nCerca de la Frontera Kilrathi/Terrestre"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "We're at full alert, everyone."
msgstr "Estamos en alerta máxima."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Our retreat across the border won't be as clean as we'd hoped."
msgstr "Nuestra retirada al otro lado de la frontera no estará tan despejada como esperábamos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "We are already tracking several inbounds approaching from multiple vectors."
msgstr "Ya estamos detectando varias naves entrantes que se acercan desde múltiples vectores."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Each of which could mean our destruction."
msgstr "Y cada una de ellas podría significar nuestra destrucción."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "All of you will launch immediately, one wing after another to stop them."
msgstr "Todos ustedes saldrán de inmediato, un ala detrás de otra para detenerlos."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "There are only two ways this can go, people..."
msgstr "Esto solo puede terminar de dos formas, pilotos..."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "...either the Claw survives, or it doesn't."
msgstr "...o la Garra sobrevive, o no lo hace."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "If we survive, we'll be jumping as fast as possible on a course for Vega sector."
msgstr "Si sobrevivimos, saltaremos tan rápido como sea posible rumbo al Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Questions?"
msgstr "¿Alguna pregunta?"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "No? Okay, wing assignments."
msgstr "¿No? Vale, asignaciones de las alas."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "$N and Marshall are Upsilon Wing, $N is still wingleader. "
msgstr "$N y Marshall formarán el Ala Upsilon, $N sigue siendo el líder de ala"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "$N, you're Upsilon Wing. I can't spare you a wingman."
msgstr "$N, usted formará el Ala Upsilon. No tengo ningún copiloto de sobra."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "The other wings are assigned quickly and efficiently."
msgstr "El resto de alas reciben sus asignaciones rápida y eficientemente."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "That's all. Prepare to launch. Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo. Prepárense para despegar. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, gentlemen."
msgstr "Bienvenidos de vuelta, caballeros."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Welcome back, $C."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I've got to get to the bridge for the jump...fill me in quickly on your kills."
msgstr "Tengo que ir al puente para el salto... póngame al día rápidamente de sus muertes."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Yes, Colonel. I killed $K."
msgstr "Sí, Coronel. He matado $K."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Yes, Colonel. I didn't kill anything, sir."
msgstr "Sí, Coronel. No he matado a ninguno, Señor."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "That's why we're fleeing, $C. Your inability to perform."
msgstr "Por eso estamos huyendo, $C. Por su incapacidad de ejecución."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "Maniac knocked out $L."
msgstr "Maniac acabó con $L."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Maniac was blanked."
msgstr "Maniac ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "And Marshall...I had hopes for that kid.  I'm glad you survived, $R."
msgstr "Y Marshall... bueno, aún tenía esperanzas con ese chaval. Al menos usted ha sobrevivido, $R."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "$C, I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, luego quiero verle en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$C! What are you doing here? We're in a Code Red alert!"
msgstr "¡$C! ¿Qué está haciendo aquí? ¡Tenemos una alerta de Código Rojo!"

msgctxt "sm1/BRIEFING.001/packet/33/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "You'd better head to Briefing. We'll talk after the show."
msgstr "Será mejor que se dirija a la Sesión Informativa. Ya hablaremos después de la reunión."

